<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Hiob</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hiob Nhoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hiob</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hiob</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hiob Nhoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Ɔbarima bi tenaa ase wɔ Us<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Us yɛ ɔman bi a na ɛda Yordan apuei fam. Na Hiob nyɛ Israelni.</char></note> asase so a na ne din de Hiob. Na ne ho nni asɛm na ɔyɛ pɛ; na osuro Onyankopɔn, na ɔtwe ne ho fi bɔne ho. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Na ɔwɔ mmabarima baason ne mmabea baasa, <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>na ɔwɔ nguan mpem ason, yoma mpem abiɛsa, anantwi mpamho ahannum ne mfurumbere ahannum, na ɔwɔ asomfo bebree. Na ɔyɛ onipa kɛse pa ara wɔ nnipa a wɔwɔ Apuei fam nyinaa no mu.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Na ne mmabarima no to pon nnidiso nnidiso wɔ wɔn afi mu, na wɔto nsa frɛ wɔn nuabeanom baasa no ne wɔn bɔ mu didi, nom. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Sɛ aponto nna no twa mu a, Hiob soma kɔfrɛ wɔn na wodwira wɔn ho. Ɔsɔre anɔpahema bɔ ɔhyew afɔre ma wɔn mu biara, efisɛ na osusuw sɛ, “Ebia na me mma no ayɛ bɔne na wɔadome Onyankopɔn wɔ wɔn koma mu.” Eyi yɛ dwuma a na Hiob di no bere ano bere ano.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Sɔhwɛ A Edi Kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Da bi, abɔfo no de wɔn ho bɛkyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na Satan kaa wɔn ho bae. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan se, “Wufi he na wobaa ha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Mifi asase so akyinkyinakyinkyin ne emu akɔneabadi mu.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan se, “Woadwene me somfo Hiob ho ana? Obiara nte sɛ ɔno wɔ asase so, ne ho nni asɛm na ɔteɛ, ɔyɛ onipa a osuro Onyankopɔn na okyi bɔne.”<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Hiob suro Onyankopɔn kwa ana? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Wunnyee ban mfaa ɔno, ne fie ne biribiara a ɔwɔ ho ana? Woahyira ne nsa ano adwuma so, enti ne nguan ne nʼanantwi ase atrɛw asase no so. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Na wo de, teɛ wo nsa na sɛe nea ɔwɔ nyinaa, na obegyina wʼanim na wadome wo.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Satan se, “Eye, nea ɔwɔ nyinaa wɔ wo nsam, nanso ɔno ankasa de, mfa wo nsateaa nka no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">Na Satan fii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim kɔe.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Da bi a Hiob mmabarima ne ne mmabea redidi na wɔrenom bobesa wɔ wɔn nuabarima panyin fi no, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>ɔbɔfo bi baa Hiob hɔ bɛkae se, “Anantwi no refuntum na mfurum no redidi wɔ wɔn nkyɛn no, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Sabiafo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Sabiafo yɛ atubrafo a na wɔte Arabia anafo fam.</char></note> bɛtow hyɛɛ yɛn so, sesaw wɔn kɔe. Wɔde afoa kunkum apaafo no, na me nko ara na miguanee a merebɛbɔ wo saa amanneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Bere a ogu so rekasa no, ɔbɔfo foforo bi ba bɛkae se, “Onyankopɔn gya fi soro abɛhyew wo nguan ne wo nguanhwɛfo no nyinaa, na me nko ara na miguanee a merebɛbɔ wo amanneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>Ogu so rekasa no, ɔbɔfo foforo bi bɛkae se, “Kaldeafo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Kaldeafo yɛ atubrafo a wɔte sare a ɛwɔ Mesopotamia so. Wɔn ara na wɔbɛtenaa Babilonia yɛɛ no ahemman.</char></note> de akorɔmfo akuw abiɛsa baa wo yoma so bɛsoaa wɔn kɔe. Wɔde afoa kunkum asomfo no na me nko ara na miguanee a merebɛbɔ wo amanneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Bere a ogu so rekasa no, ɔbɔfo foforo bi ba bɛkae se, “Na wo mmabarima ne wo mmabea redidi na wɔrenom bobesa wɔ wɔn nuabarima panyin fi, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>na prɛko pɛ, ahum bi bɔ fii sare no so bedwiraa ofi no ntwea anan no. Ofi no dwiriw guu wɔn so na akunkum wɔn, na me nko ara na miguanee a merebɛbɔ wo amanneɛ yi.”<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Eyi maa Hiob sɔre gyinaa hɔ, sunsuan nʼatade mu na oyii ne tinwi. Afei ɔtenaa fam sɔree <char style="nd">Awurade</char> <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>kae se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">“Adagyaw na mede fi me na yam bae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">na adagyaw na mede bɛsan akɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de mae, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">nhyira nka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din!”<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Eyi nyinaa mu no, Hiob anyɛ bɔne sɛ ɔbɛbɔ Onyankopɔn sobo.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Sɔhwɛ A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Da foforo bi, abɔfo no baa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim bio na Satan nso kaa wɔn ho bae. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan se, “Wufi he na wobaa ha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Mifi asase so akyinkyinakyinkyin ne emu akɔneabadi mu.”<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa Satan se, “Woadwene mʼakoa Hiob ho ana? Obiara nte sɛ ɔno wɔ asase so, ne ho nni asɛm na ɔteɛ. Ɔyɛ onipa a osuro Onyankopɔn na okyi bɔne. Ɛwɔ mu sɛ wohyɛɛ me sɛ mensɛe no a minni nnyinaso biara de, nanso ɔda so gyina ne pɛpɛyɛ no mu.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Satan buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Were pere were. Onipa de nea ɔwɔ nyinaa bɛma de apere ne nkwa. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Sɛ ebetumi a teɛ wo nsa fa ka ne honam ne ne nnompe, na ɔbɛdome wo wɔ wʼanim!”<verse eid="JOB 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Satan se, “Eye, ɔwɔ wo nsam na ne nkwa de gyaa mu ma no.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Enti Satan fii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, na ɔmaa akuru a ɛyɛ yaw totɔɔ Hiob ho fi ne nʼanan ase kosii nʼapampam. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Afei, na kyɛmfɛre na Hiob de twiw ne ho, bere a ɔte nsõ mu.<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Ne yere bisaa no se, “Woda so kura wo pɛpɛyɛ no mu ara? Dome Onyankopɔn, na wu!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Na Hiob buaa no sɛ, “Wokasa sɛ ɔbea a ɔyɛ ɔkwasea. Ade pa de yɛagye afi Onyankopɔn nsam na ade bɔne na yɛmpo ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Eyi nyinaa mu no, Hiob anka asɛm bɔne.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Nnamfo Baasa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Bere a Hiob nnamfo baasa bi a wɔne Temanni Elifas,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Elifas yɛ Edomni a ofi Teman.</char></note> Suhini Bildad ne Naamani Sofar tee amanehunu a aba Hiob so no, wofii wɔn afi mu, hyia yɛɛ adwene sɛ wɔbɛkɔ akɔhwɛ no na wɔakyekye ne werɛ. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Wohuu Hiob fii akyiri no, wɔanhu sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno; wɔhyɛɛ ase twaa agyaadwo, sunsuan wɔn ntade mu, tuu mfutuma guu wɔn ti so. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Na wɔne no tenaa fam nnanson, awia ne anadwo. Na obiara ankasa, efisɛ wohuu sɛ nʼamanehunu no nyɛ adewa.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Kasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Akyiri no Hiob kasae, na ɔdomee da a wɔwoo no. <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>Ɔkae se,<verse eid="JOB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>“Ma da a wɔwoo me no nyera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">ne anadwo a wɔkae se, ‘Wɔawo ɔbabarima no!’<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Saa da no nnuru sum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">mma Ɔsoro Nyankopɔn nhwehwɛ akyi kwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">mma hann biara ntɔ ngu so.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Ma sum ne owusum nnye no mfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ma omununkum nkata so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">na sum mmunkam ne hann so.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Ma sum kabii nnye saa anadwo no mfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">ma wonyi saa anadwo no mfi asranna so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">na wɔmmfa nhyɛ ɔsram biara mu.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Saa anadwo no nyɛ obonin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">mma wɔnnte anigye nteɛmu wɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Ma wɔn a wɔdome nna no nnome saa da no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">wɔn a wɔayɛ krado sɛ wɔbɛkanyan dɛnkyɛmmirampɔn no.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Ma nʼanɔpa nsoromma nnuru sum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">na ɔntwɛn adekyee kwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">a onhu anɔpawia nsensanee a edi kan no,<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>efisɛ anto nea ɔwoo me no awotwaa mu ama wawo me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">na anka mʼani renhu saa abɛbrɛsɛ yi.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>“Adɛn nti na manwu awoe hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">bere a mifi me na awotwaa mu no?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Adɛn nti na nkotodwe gyee me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">ne nufu sɛ minnum?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Anka sesɛɛ meda hɔ asomdwoe mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">anka mada regye mʼahome<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>me ne wiase ahemfo ne fotufo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">wɔn a wosisii adan maa wɔn ho na nnɛ yi abubu no,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>me ne ahenemma a na wɔwɔ sika kɔkɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">wɔn a wɔde dwetɛ hyɛɛ wɔn afi mu ma.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Anaasɛ adɛn nti na wɔansie me sɛ ɔpɔnba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">te sɛ akokoaa a wanhu adekyee hann da?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Ɛhɔ na amumɔyɛfo gyae basabasayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">na abrɛfo nya ahomegye.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Nneduafo nso nya wɔn ahofadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">na wɔnte nnommumfo wuranom ateɛteɛ bio.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Nketewa ne akɛse wɔ hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">na akoa de ne ho fi ne wura nsam.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>“Adɛn nti na wɔma mmɔborɔfo hann,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">na ɔkra mu ahohiahiafo nya nkwa,<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>wɔn a wɔn kɔn dɔ owu nanso ɛmma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">wɔn a wɔbrɛ hwehwɛ owu sen sɛnea wɔhwehwɛ nnwetɛbona,<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>wɔn a anigye ahyɛ wɔn ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">na wodu ɔda mu a wodi ahurusi.<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Adɛn nti na wɔde nkwa ma onipa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">ne kwan ahintaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">nea Onyankopɔn aka no ahyɛ mu?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Ahomekokogu adan mʼaduan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">na mʼapinisi gu te sɛ nsu.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Nea na misuro no aba me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">nea na ɛbɔ me hu no ato me.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Minni ahotɔ, minni asomdwoe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:26">minni ahomegye na mmom, ɔhaw nko ara.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Elifas Mmuae A Edi Kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Na Temanni Elifas buaa Hiob se,<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔne wo kasa a, worennya ntoboase ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Hena na wobetumi aka nʼano ato mu?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Dwene sɛnea wakyerɛkyerɛ nnipa bebree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">sɛnea woahyɛ nsa a emu ayɛ mmerɛw no den.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Wo nsɛm ahyɛ wɔn a wɔahintiw no den;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">woahyɛ nkotodwe a ayɛ mmerɛw mu den.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Na afei a ɔhaw aba no, wʼaba mu abu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">adwira wo, na wo werɛ ahow.<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>So ɛnsɛ sɛ wo nyamesuro yɛ wʼahotoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">na wʼakwan a ɛho nni asɛm no yɛ wʼanidaso ana?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>“Dwene ho: Wɔasɛe obi a ne ho nni asɛm pɛn ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Ɛhefa na wɔsɛee obi a ɔyɛ pɛ?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Sɛnea mahu no, wɔn a wofuntum bɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">ne wɔn a wodua ɔhaw no twa so aba.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Onyankopɔn home ano, wɔsɛe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">nʼabufuw turuw a wɔyera.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Gyata betumi abobɔ mu na wɔaworo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">nanso wɔabubu gyata akɛse no se.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Gyata annya hanam a owu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">na gyatabere mma no bɔ hwete.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>“Wɔbɛkaa kokoamsɛm bi kyerɛɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">na mʼaso tee no sɛ asomsɛm.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Wɔ anadwo daeso basabasa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">bere a nnipa adeda nnahɔɔ no,<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>ehu ne nketenkete kyeree me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">ɛmaa me nnompe nyinaa wosowee.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Honhom bi twaa mʼani so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">na me ho nwi sɔre gyinae.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Egyinae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">nanso, manhu nʼabɔsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Biribi begyinaa mʼanim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">na metee nne bɔkɔɔ bi a ɛrebisa se,<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‘Onipa desani betumi ateɛ asen Onyankopɔn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Na mpo ɔhoɔdenfo betumi ayɛ kronkron asen ne Yɛfo ana?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Sɛ Onyankopɔn ntumi mfa ne ho nto nʼankasa asomfo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">sɛ ɔka nʼabɔfo mfomso kyerɛ wɔn a,<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>na nkantom wɔn a wɔtete dɔte afi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">wɔn a wɔn fapem sisi mfutuma mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">na wɔdwerɛw wɔn ntɛm so sen abubummaba!<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Efi anɔpahema kosi anwummere wobubu wɔn mu nketenkete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">na wɔyera korakora a obiara nhu wɔn bio.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>So wommiamia wɔn ntamadan ahama mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">a ɛno nti wowuwu a wonni nyansa ana?’<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>“Wobɛfrɛ a frɛ, na hena na obegye wo so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Akronkronfo no mu hena nkyɛn na wobɛkɔ?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Ahisɛm kum ɔkwasea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">na anibere kum atetekwaa.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Mʼankasa mahu ɔkwasea a ɔrefefɛw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">nanso mpofirim, wɔdomee ne fi.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Ne mma ne bammɔ ntam kwan ware,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">wɔdwerɛw wɔn wɔ asennii a wonni ɔkamafo.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Nea ɔkɔm de no no di ne nnɔbae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">na ɔfa fi nsɔe mu mpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">na nea osukɔm de no no pere di nʼahode akyi.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Ahokyere mpue mmfi dɔte mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">na ɔhaw nso mfifi mmfi fam.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Nanso wɔwo nnipa to ɔhaw mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">mpɛn dodow a gyaframa turuw kɔ soro no.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>“Nanso sɛ ɛyɛ me a, anka meguan atoa Onyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">na mede mʼasɛm ato nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Ɔyɛ anwonwade a wontumi nhwehwɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">ne nsɛnkyerɛnne a wontumi nkan ne dodow.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Ɔtɔ osu gu asase so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">na ɔde kɔ wuram.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Ɔde ahobrɛasefo si nea ɛkorɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">na ɔma wɔn a wodi awerɛhow nya asomdwoe.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Ɔsɛe aniferefo nhyehyɛe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">ma wɔn nsa si fam.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Ɔkyere anyansafo wɔ wɔn anifere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">na ɔbɔ anitewfo nhyehyɛe gu.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Sum duru wɔn awia ketee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">na wɔkeka wɔ owigyinae mu te sɛ anadwo.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Ogye ahiafo fi afoa a ɛhyɛ wɔn anom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">ogye wɔn fi ahoɔdenfo nkyehama mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Enti ahiafo wɔ anidaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">na ntɛnkyew ka nʼano to mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>“Nhyira ne onipa a Onyankopɔn teɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">enti mmu Otumfo nteɛteɛ no animtiaa.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Efisɛ ɔno na opira na ɔno ara akyekyere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">opira nanso ne nsa sa yare.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Obegye wo afi ɔhaw ahorow asia mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">ason so no, bɔne biara renka wo.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Ɔkɔm ba a, obegye wo afi owu mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">na ɔko mu nso, obegye wo afi afoa ano.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Wɔbɛbɔ wo ho ban afi ntwirii ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">na sɛ ɔsɛe ba a ɛnsɛ sɛ wusuro.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Wobɛserew ɔsɛe ne ɔkɔm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">na ɛnsɛ sɛ wusuro asase so mmoa.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Wo ne afuw so abo bɛyɛ apam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">na emu nkekaboa nso ne wo bɛtena asomdwoe mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Wubehu sɛ wo ntamadan wɔ bammɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">na sɛ wosese wʼahode a wubehu sɛ hwee nyeraa ɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Wubehu sɛ wo mma bɛyɛ bebree;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">na wʼase bɛfɛe sɛ asase so sare.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Wode ahoɔden bɛkɔ ɔda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">te sɛ afiafi a wɔaboa ano wɔ otwabere mu.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>“Yɛahwehwɛ eyi mu, na ɛyɛ nokware</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">ɛno nti tie na fa toto wʼabrabɔ ho.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Elifas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Na Hiob buae se,<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>“Sɛ wobetumi akari mʼawerɛhowdi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">na me haw nso wɔde agu nsania so a,<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>anka emu bɛyɛ duru asen nwea a ɛwɔ po mu nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">enti ɛnyɛ nwonwa sɛ me nsɛm ayɛ hagyahagya.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Otumfo agyan no wɔ me mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">me honhom nom ano bɔre no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">wɔahyehyɛ Onyankopɔn ahunahuna nyinaa atia me.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Wuram afurum su wɔ bere a wanya sare ana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">na nantwi nso su wɔ bere a wanya nʼaduan ana?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>So wodi aduan a nkyene nni mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">Na ɔdɛ bi wɔ nkesua mu fufu mu ana?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Mempɛ sɛ mede me nsa ka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">aduan a ɛte saa no bɔ me yare.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>“Ao sɛ me nsa bɛka mʼabisade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛyɛ nea mʼani da so no ama me,<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛpɛ sɛ ɔdwerɛw me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">sɛ ɔbɛtwe ne nsa na wakum me,<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>ɛne anka mɛkɔ so anya saa awerɛkyekye yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">a ɛyɛ anigye a mewɔ wɔ ɔyaw a entwa da yi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ne Ɔkronkronni no nsɛm a mimmuu so yi.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>“Ahoɔden bɛn na mewɔ a enti ɛsɛ sɛ minya anidaso?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Daakye nneɛma pa bɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ minya ntoboase?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Mewɔ ahoɔden sɛ ɔbo ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Me honam yɛ kɔbere mfrafrae ana?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>So mewɔ tumi bi a mede bɛboa me ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">saa bere yi a nkonimdi apare me yi ana?<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>“Obiara a ɔbɔ nʼadamfo ayamye sɛn no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">gyaw Otumfo no ho suro.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Nanso ahotoso nni me nuanom mu sɛ nsuwansuwa a eyiri na ɛyow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">sɛ nsuwansuwa a eyiri<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>bere a sukyerɛmma renan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">na mparuwbo nso redan nsu,<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>nanso owiabere mu no ɛsen bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">na ɔhyew nti nsu no tu yera.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Akwantufo man fi wɔn akwan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">wɔforo kɔ nsase a awuwu so ma wowuwu.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Tema akwantufo hwehwɛ nsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">Seba aguadifo akwantufo de anidaso hwehwɛ nsu.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Wɔn ho yeraw wɔn, efisɛ na wɔwɔ awerehyɛmu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">woduu hɔ, na wɔn anidaso yɛ ɔkwa.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Afei, wo nso woakyerɛ sɛ wo so nni mfaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">wuhu biribi a ɛyɛ hu na wusuro.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>So maka pɛn se, ‘Me nti momma biribi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">sɛ mumfi mo ahode mu ntua me ti so sika,<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>sɛ munnye me mfi mʼatamfo nsam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">ne atirimɔdenfo nkyehama mu ana?’<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>“Monkyerɛkyerɛ me, na mɛyɛ komm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">monkyerɛ me mfomso a mayɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Nokwareka yɛ yaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">na mo adwenkyerɛ no kosi dɛn?<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>So mokyerɛ sɛ mubesiesie sɛ nea meka no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">na moafa mʼahometew nsɛm sɛ mframa ana?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Mpo mobɛbɔ ayisaa so ntonto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:27">na mode mo adamfo adi nsesagua.<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>“Afei momfa ahummɔbɔ nhwɛ me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">Metumi adi atoro wɔ mo anim ana?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Montɔ mo bo ase, mummu ntɛnkyew;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">monsan nnwen ho, efisɛ eyi fa me pɛpɛyɛ ho.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Amumɔyɛsɛm wɔ mʼano ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Minnim papa ne bɔne ntam nsonoe ana?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>“Asase so som nyɛ den mma onipa ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Ne nkwanna nte sɛ ɔpaani de?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Sɛnea akoa ani gyina anwummere sunsuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">anaasɛ ɔpaani ho pere no nʼakatua ho no,<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>saa ara na wɔatwa asram hunu ato me hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">ne anadwo a ɔhaw wɔ mu ama me.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Sɛ meda a, midwen bisa se, ‘Bere bɛn na ade bɛkye?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Nanso anadwo twa mu nkakrankakra, na mepere kosi ahemadakye.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Asunson ne aporɔporɔw afura me nipadua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">me were atetew na ɛrefi nsu.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>“Me nna kɔ ntɛm sen ɔnwemfo akurokurowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">na ɛkɔ awiei a anidaso biara nni mu.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Ao, Onyankopɔn, kae sɛ me nkwanna te sɛ ɔhome;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">na mʼani renhu anigye bio da.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Ani a ehu me mprempren no renhu me bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">mobɛhwehwɛ me, nanso na minni hɔ bio.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Sɛnea omununkum yera na etu kɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">saa ara na nea ɔkɔ ɔda mu no nsan mma bio.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Ɔrensan mma ne fi da biara da bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">nʼatenae renkae no bio.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>“Ɛno nti meremmua mʼano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">mifi me honhom ahoyeraw mu akasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">mefi me kra ɔyaw mu anwiinwii.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>So meyɛ ɛpo anaa aboa kɛse a ɔwɔ bun mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">na mode me ahyɛ ɔwɛmfo nsa yi?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Sɛ midwen sɛ minya awerɛkyekye wɔ me mpa so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">na mʼakongua adwudwo mʼanwiinwii ano a,<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>ɛno mpo na wode adaeso yi me hu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">na wode anisoadehu hunahuna me,<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>ɛno nti mepɛ ɔsɛn ne owu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">sen me nipadua yi.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Mimmu me nkwa; mentena ase afebɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">Munnyaa me; na me nna nka hwee.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>“Ɔdesani ne hena a ne ho hia wo sɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">na wʼani ku ne ho,<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>na wohwehwɛ ne mu anɔpa biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">na wosɔ no hwɛ bere biara?<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Worennyi wʼani mfi me so da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">anaasɛ worennyaa me bere tiaa bi mpo ana?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Sɛ mayɛ bɔne a, dɛn na mayɛ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ao adesamma so wɛmfo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Adɛn nti na watu wʼani asi me so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Mayɛ adesoa ama wo ana?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Adɛn nti na wonkata me mmarato so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">na womfa me bɔne nkyɛ me?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Ɛrenkyɛ biara, mɛda mfutuma mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Wobɛhwehwɛ me nanso na minni hɔ bio.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildad Asɛnka A Edi Kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Na Suhini Bildad buae se:<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>“Wobɛkɔ so aka saa nsɛm yi akosi da bɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Wo nsɛm yɛ mframa huhuw.<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Onyankopɔn kyea atɛntrenee ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Otumfo kyea nea ɛteɛ ana?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Bere a wo mma yɛɛ bɔne tiaa no no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">ogyaw wɔn maa wɔn bɔne so akatua.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Nanso sɛ wode wʼani bɛto Onyankopɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">na woabɔ Otumfo no mpae,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>sɛ woyɛ kronkron, na woteɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">wo nti, ɔbɛma ne ho so mprempren</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">na wama wo asi wo dedaw mu.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Wo mfiase bɛyɛ nkakrankakra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">na daakye woanya ama abu so.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>“Bisa awo ntoatoaso a atwa mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">na hwehwɛ nea wɔn agyanom hui,<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>na wɔwoo yɛn nkyɛe na yennim hwee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">yɛn nna wɔ asase yi so te sɛ sunsuma.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Wɔrenkyerɛkyerɛ wo na wɔrenka nkyerɛ wo ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">Wɔremfi wɔn ntease mu nka nsɛm bi ana?<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>So paparɔso betumi anyin akɔ soro wɔ baabi a ɛnyɛ ɔwora?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Demmire betumi afifi baabi a nsu nni ana?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Bere a ɛrenyin a wontwae no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">ɛhyew ntɛm so sen sare.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Saa na wɔn a wɔn werɛ fi Onyankopɔn no awiei te;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">saa ara na wɔn a wonni nyamesu no anidaso nkosi hwee.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Biribiara a nʼani da so no nni ahoɔden;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:14">nea ɔde ne ho to so no yɛ ananse ntontan.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Otweri ne ntontan, nanso ɛtetew;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">oso mu dennen, nanso ɛnyɛ yie.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Ɔte sɛ afifide a wogugu so nsu yiye a esi owia mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">ɛtrɛtrɛw ne mman mu wɔ turo no so;<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Ne ntin nyin fa abotan ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">na ɛhwehwɛ ɔkwan kɔ abo mu.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Nanso sɛ wotu fi ne sibea a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">saa beae no nnim no bio na ɛka se, ‘Minhuu wo da.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Ampa ara ne nkwa twa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">na afifide foforo nyin asase no so.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>“Ampa ara Onyankopɔn mpo onipa a ne ho nni asɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">na ɔnhyɛ amumɔyɛfo nsa mu den.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Ɔbɛma woaserew bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">na wode ahosɛpɛw ateɛteɛ mu.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Wɔde aniwu befura wɔn a wɔtan wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:22">na amumɔyɛfo ntamadan bɛsɛe.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Na Hiob kasaa bio se:<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>“Yiw, minim sɛ eyi yɛ nokware.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ɔdesani bɛteɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn anim?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔne Onyankopɔn yiyi ano a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">ɔrentumi nyi nsɛm apem mu baako mpo ano.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Ne nyansa mu dɔ, na ne tumi so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">Hena na ɔne no adi asi na ne ho baabiara anti?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Otutu mmepɔw a wonnim ho hwee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">obubu wɔn fa so wɔ nʼabufuw mu.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Ɔwosow asase fi ne sibea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">na ɔma ne nnyinaso wosow biribiri.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Ɔkasa kyerɛ owia na ɛnhyerɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">na ɔsɔw nsoromma hyerɛn ano.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Ɔno nko ara na ɔtrɛw ɔsoro mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">na ɔnantew po asorɔkye so.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Ɔno ne Nyankrɛnte, Akokɔbeatan ne ne mma Yɛfo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">anafo fam nsorommakuw no.<verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Ɔyɛ anwonwade a wontumi nte ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">nsɛnkyerɛnne a wontumi nkan.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>Sɛ ɔnam me ho a, minhu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">sɛ ɔsen a, minhu no.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Sɛ ohwim kɔ a, hena na osiw no kwan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">Hena na obetumi abisa no se, ‘Dɛn na woreyɛ yi?’<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Onyankopɔn nkora nʼabufuw so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:13">Rahab aboafo mpo ho popo wɔ nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>“Na me ne hena a mene no beyiyi ano?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Mɛyɛ dɛn anya nsɛm a me ne no de begye akyinnye?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Sɛ minnim ho hwee mpo a, merentumi nyi nʼano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">ɛno ara ne sɛ mɛsrɛ ahummɔbɔ afi me temmufo nkyɛn.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Mpo, sɛ mefrɛ no na ɔba a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">minnye nni sɛ obetie mʼasɛm.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Ɔde asorɔkye bɛhwe me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">ama mʼapirakuru adɔɔso kwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Ɔremma minnya mʼahome, bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">ɔde awerɛhow bɛhyɛ me ma tɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Sɛ ɛyɛ ahoɔden asɛm a, ɔyɛ ɔhoɔdenfo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Na sɛ ɛba atɛntrenee nso a, hena na ɔne no bedi asi?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Sɛ midi bem mpo a, mʼano bebu me kumfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">sɛ me ho nni asɛm a, ebebu me fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>“Ɛwɔ mu sɛ midi bem de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">nanso mimmu me ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">abrabɔ afono me.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Ne nyinaa yɛ pɛ; ɛno nti na meka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">‘Ɔsɛe nea ne ho nni asɛm ne omumɔyɛfo.’<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Bere a amanehunu de owu aba no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">ɔserew nea ne ho nni asɛm no abawpa.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Bere a asase akɔ amumɔyɛfo nsam no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">ofura ɛso atemmufo ani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Sɛ ɛnyɛ ɔno a, na ɛyɛ hena?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>“Me nna ho yɛ hare sen ommirikatufo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">ɛsen kɔ a anigye kakra mpo nni mu.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Etwa mu kɔ sɛ akorow a wɔde paparɔso ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">te sɛ akɔre a wɔretow akyere wɔn hanam.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Sɛ meka se, ‘Me werɛ mfi mʼanwiinwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">mɛsakra me nsɛnka, na maserew a,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>me yaw ahorow no bɔ me hu ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:28">Na minim sɛ, woremmu me bem.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Woabu me fɔ dedaw nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">adɛn na ɛsɛ sɛ mehaw me ho kwa?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Mpo sɛ ɛba sɛ mede samina guare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">na mede samina hohoro me nsa ho a,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>wobɛtow me akyene dontori amoa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">ama mʼatade mpo akyi me.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>“Ɔnyɛ onipa te sɛ me na mayi nʼano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">na yɛakogyina asennii abobɔ yɛn nkuro.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Sɛ anka obi wɔ hɔ a obesiesie yɛn ntam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">na waka yɛn baanu abɔ mu,<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>obi a obeyi Onyankopɔn abaa afi me so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">na nʼahunahuna ammɔ me hu bio.<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>Anka mɛkasa a merensuro no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:35">nanso saa tebea a mewɔ mu yi de, mintumi.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>“Abrabɔ afono me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">enti mɛka mʼasɛm a meremfa hwee nsie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">na mɛkasa afi me kra yawdi mu.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Mɛka akyerɛ Onyankopɔn se: Mmu me kumfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">na mmom kyerɛ kwaadu a wobɔ me.<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Ɛyɛ wo fɛ sɛ wohyɛ me so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">de po wo nsa ano adwuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">na woserew hwɛ amumɔyɛfo nhyehyɛe?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Wowɔ ɔhonam mu ani ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Wuhu ade te sɛ ɔdesani ana?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Wo nkwanna te sɛ ɔdesani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">anaa wo mfe te sɛ onipa hoɔdenfo,<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>a enti ɛsɛ sɛ wohwehwɛ me mfomso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">na wopɛɛpɛɛ me bɔne mu?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Ɛwɔ mu, wunim sɛ minni fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:7">na obiara nso ntumi nnye me mfi wo nsam.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>“Wo nsa na ɛnwenee me na ɛbɔɔ me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">Afei wobɛdan wo ho asɛe me ana?<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Kae sɛ wonwen me sɛ dɔte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">Na wobɛdan me ayɛ me mfutuma bio ana?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>So woanhwie me sɛ nufusu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">na woammɔ me toa sɛ srade,<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>amfa were ne honam ankata me ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">ankeka nnompe ne ntin antoatoa mu ana?<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Womaa me nkwa, yii ayamye kyerɛɛ me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">na ɔhwɛsie mu wohwɛɛ me honhom so.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>“Nanso eyi na wode siee wo koma mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">na minim sɛ na eyi wɔ wʼadwene mu.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Sɛ meyɛɛ bɔne a anka wobɛhwɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">na wobɛma me so asotwe.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Na sɛ midi fɔ a, nnome nka me!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Na sɛ mpo midi bem a, merentumi mma me ti so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">efisɛ aniwu ahyɛ me ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">na mʼamanehunu amene me.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Na sɛ mema me ti so a, wodɛɛdɛɛ me sɛ gyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">na bio woda wʼanwonwatumi no adi tia me.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Wode nnansefo foforo betia me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">na woma wʼabufuw ano yɛ den wɔ me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">wʼasraafo tu ba me so bere biara.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>“Adɛn nti na woma wɔwoo me?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Ɛkaa me nko a anka miwui ansa na ani bi rehu me.<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Sɛ anka mamma nkwa yi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">anaasɛ wɔsoaa me fi awotwaa mu de me kɔɔ ɔda mu tee!<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>So ɛnkaa kakraa bi na me nna kakraa no to ntwaa ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Gyaa me na minya anigye bere tiaa bi<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>ansa na makɔ koransan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">kusuuyɛ ne sunsuma kabii asase so,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>asase a ɛyɛ anadwo sum kabii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">sum kabii ne sakasaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">baabi a ɛhɔ hann mpo te sɛ sum.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Sofar Mmuae A Edi Kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Na Naamani Sofar buae se,<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>“Ɛnsɛ sɛ woyi saa nsɛm yi ano ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Ɛsɛ sɛ wobu saa ɔkasafo yi bem ana?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Wo nsɛm hunu no bɛma nnipa ayɛ komm ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Sɛ wudi fɛw a obiara nka wʼanim ana?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Woka kyerɛ Onyankopɔn se, ‘Me gyidi ho nni asɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">na meyɛ pɛ wɔ wʼani so.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Ao, anka mepɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn kasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">anka ɔnkasa ntia wo<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>na ommue nyansa mu ahintasɛm so nkyerɛ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">efisɛ nyansa turodoo yɛ afanu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Hu sɛ Onyankopɔn werɛ afi wo bɔne no bi mpo.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>“Wubetumi ate Onyankopɔn anwonwade ase ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">Wubetumi abɔre ahu nea Otumfo no tumi kɔpem ana?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Ɛkorɔn sen ɔsoro, dɛn na wubetumi ayɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Emu dɔ sen ɔda ase tɔnn, dɛn na wubetumi ahu?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Ne nsusuwii mu ware sen asase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">na ɛtrɛw sen po.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>“Sɛ ɔba de wo bɛto afiase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">ansa na osi nkongua a, hena na obetumi asiw no kwan?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Ampa ara ohu nnipa nnaadaafo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">na sɛ ohu bɔne a, ɔnhyɛ ne nsow ana?<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Nanso ogyimifo rentumi nyɛ onyansafo da</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">na wɔawo afurum ba sɛ onipa.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>“Na sɛ wode wo koma ma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">na wopagyaw wo nsa kyerɛ no,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>sɛ wugyaa bɔne a wukura no mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">na woamma amumɔyɛ antena wo ntamadan mu a<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>ɛno de, bɔne nni wo ho, wobɛma wo ti so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">wubegyina pintinn a worensuro.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Wo werɛ befi wʼahokyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">na wɔbɛkae no sɛ nsu a asen kɔ.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Abrabɔ bɛhyerɛn asen owigyinae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">na sum bɛyɛ sɛ adekyee hann.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Wubenya bammɔ, efisɛ anidaso wɔ hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">wobɛhwɛ wo ho ahyia, na wahome asomdwoe mu.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Wobɛda ahome, na obi renhunahuna wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">na bebree bɛhwehwɛ mmoa afi wo nkyɛn.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Amumɔyɛfo ani befura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">wɔrentumi nguan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">na wɔn anidaso bɛdan owu ahomegu.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Sofar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Na Hiob buae se,<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>“Akyinnye nni ho, mo ne nnipa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">na muwu a na nyansa asa!<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Nanso mewɔ adwene sɛ mo ara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">monnsen me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Hena na onnim saa nneɛma yi nyinaa?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>“Mayɛ aserewde ama me nnamfonom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">mefrɛɛ Onyankopɔn na obuae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">aserewde teta bi, nanso meteɛ na me ho nni asɛm.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Nnipa a wɔn ho tɔ wɔn no bu amanehunu animtiaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">sɛnea wobu wɔn a wɔn nan rewatiri no awiei animtiaa no.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Wɔmmfa wɔn nsa nka akorɔmfo ntamadan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">na wɔn a woyi Onyankopɔn abufuw wɔ bammɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">na Onyankopɔn bɔ nea ɔde ma wɔn ho ban.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>“Bisa mmoa no, na wɔbɛkyerɛ wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">anaasɛ wim nnomaa no, na wɔbɛka akyerɛ wo<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>anaasɛ kasa kyerɛ asase, na ɛbɛkyerɛ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">anaasɛ ma po mu mpataa nka nkyerɛ wo.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Wɔn nyinaa mu hena na onnim sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsa na ayɛ eyi.<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Ne nsam na abɔde nyinaa home wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">ne adesamma nyinaa home.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>So aso nsɔ nsɛm nhwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">sɛnea tɛkrɛma ka aduan hwɛ no ana?<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Wonnya nyansa mfi mpanyin nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">na ɛnyɛ onyinkyɛ na ɛde ntease ba ana?<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>“Nyansa ne tumi yɛ Onyankopɔn de;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">afotu ne ntease yɛ ne dea.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Nea obubu gu no, obiara rentumi nsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">nea ɔde no to afiase no, obiara rentumi nyi no.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Sɛ ɔma osu gyae tɔ a, asase no so yɛ wosee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">sɛ ogyaa osutɔ mu a, ɛsɛe asase no.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Ahoɔden ne nkonimdi yɛ ne de</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">osisifo ne nea wosisi no no nso yɛ ne de.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Ɔpa afotufo ho ntama ma wɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">na ɔma atemmufo yɛ nkwasea.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Ɔworɔw ahemfo nkyehama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">na ɔde abɔso bɔ wɔn asen.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Ɔpa asɔfo ho ntama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">na otu nnipa a wɔn ase atim akyɛ gu.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Ɔka afotufo a wogye wɔn di no kasaboa hyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">na ogye mpanyimfo nhumu.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Ɔde animguase gu atitiriw so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">na otintim gye ahoɔdenfo nsam akode.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Ɔda sum mu nneɛma a ahintaw adi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">na ɔde sum kabii ba hann mu.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Ɔyɛ aman akɛse, na ɔsɛe wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">ɔtrɛw aman mu, na ɔhwete wɔn mu.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Ogye wiase akannifo adwene fi wɔn nsam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">na ɔma wokyinkyin asase wosee a ɔkwan nna so so.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Wɔkeka wɔ sum mu a wonni kanea;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:25">na ɔma wɔtɔ ntintan sɛ asabowfo.”<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>“Mʼani ahu eyinom nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">mʼaso ate, na ate ase.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Nea wunim no, me nso minim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">wonyɛ abomfiaa mma me.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Nanso mepɛ sɛ mekasa kyerɛ Otumfo no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">na mekyerɛkyerɛ mʼasɛm mu kyerɛ Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Mode atoro mmom na asra me ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">mo nyinaa moyɛ ayaresafo a munsi hwee!<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Sɛ mobɛyɛ komm koraa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">ɛno na ɛbɛyɛ nyansa ama mo!<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Afei muntie mʼano asɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">muntie mʼanoyi.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Mobɛka amumɔyɛsɛm ama Onyankopɔn ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Mobɛka nnaadaasɛm ama no ana?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Mobɛkyea mo aso ama no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Mobɛka Onyankopɔn asɛm ama no ana?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Sɛ ɔhwehwɛ mo mu a, ebesi mo yiye ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Mubetumi adaadaa no sɛnea modaadaa nnipa no ana?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Sɛ mokyeaa mo aso wɔ kokoa mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">sɛnea ɛte biara, ɔbɛka mo anim<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Nʼanuonyam mmɔ mo hu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Ne ho suro ntɔ mo so ana?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Mo kasatɔmmɛ yɛ mmɛbu a ɛte sɛ nsõ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">mo anoyi yɛ dɔte twann anoyi.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>“Monyɛ komm mma menkasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">na nea ɛbɛyɛ me biara mmra me so.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Adɛn nti na mede me ho to amane mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">na mede me nkwa to me nsam?<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Ɛwɔ mu sɛ okum me de, nanso ne so na mʼani bɛda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ampa ara medi mʼakwan ho adanse wɔ nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Nokware, eyi na ɛbɛyɛ me nkwagye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">efisɛ nea onsuro Onyankopɔn no rentumi nkɔ nʼanim!<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Muntie me nsɛm yi yiye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">monyɛ aso mma nea meka.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Afei a masiesie me nkurobɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">minim sɛ medi bem.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Obi betumi abɔ me kwaadu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Sɛ ɛte saa de a, anka mɛyɛ komm na mawu.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>“Onyankopɔn, yɛ saa nneɛma abien yi pɛ ma me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">na afei meremfa me ho nhintaw wo:<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Yi wo nsa fi me so kɔ akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:21">na gyae wo ho hu a wode hunahuna me no.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Ɛno de, samena me na mɛba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">anaa ma menkasa na bua me.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Mfomso ne bɔne dodow ahe na mayɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Kyerɛ me me mfomso ne me bɔne.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Adɛn nti na wode wʼanim asie me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">na wudwen sɛ meyɛ wo tamfo?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Wobɛyɛ ahaban a mframa rebɔ no ayayade ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">Wobɛtaa ntɛtɛ a awo ana?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Wokyerɛw sobo a ɛyɛ yaw tia me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">na woka me mmabunmmere mu bɔne nyinaa gu me so.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Wode nkyehama gu mʼanan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">wohwɛ mʼanammɔnkwan nyinaa so yiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">na wode agyiraehyɛde ayeyɛ mʼanammɔn mu.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>“Enti onipa nkwa sa te sɛ ade a aporɔw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">te sɛ atade a nwewee adi.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>“Nnipa a ɔbea awo wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">nna yɛ tiaa bi na ɔhaw ahyɛ mu mma.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Ɔfefɛw te sɛ nhwiren na etwintwam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">ɔte sɛ sunsuma a ɛretwa mu akɔ, ɔntena hɔ nkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Woma wʼani kɔ saa onipa yi so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Wode no bɛba wʼanim abebu no atɛn ana?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Hena na obetumi ayi nea ɛyɛ kronkron afi fi mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Obiara nni hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Woahyehyɛ onipa nkwa nna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">woahyɛ nʼasram dodow ato hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">na woahyɛ no bere a ɔrentumi ntra.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Enti yi wʼani fi ne so na ɔnyɛ nea ɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">kosi sɛ obewie nʼadwuma sɛ ɔpaani.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>“Dua mpo anidaso wɔ hɔ ma no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">Sɛ wotwa a, ɛbɛfefɛw bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">na ne mman foforo no rempenpan.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Ne ntin betumi anyin akyɛ asase mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">na ne dunsin nso awu wɔ dɔte mu,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>nanso, onya nsu a ɛfefɛw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">na eyiyi mman sɛ dua a wɔatɛw.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Nanso sɛ nnipa wu a wɔde no hyɛ fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">ɔhome nea etwa to a, na afei onni hɔ bio.<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Sɛnea nsu tu yera wɔ po mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">anaa sɛnea suka mu yowee no,<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>saa ara na onipa tɔ fam na ɔnsɔre bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">enkosi sɛ ɔsoro betwa mu no, nnipa rensɔre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">na wɔrennyan wɔn mfi wɔn nna mu.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>“Sɛ anka wode me besie ɔda mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">de me ahintaw kosi sɛ wʼabufuw betwa mu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Sɛ anka wobɛhyɛ me bere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">na afei woakae me!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Sɛ onipa wu a ɔbɛba nkwa mu bio ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Mʼaperedi nna mu nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">mɛtwɛn akosi sɛ me foforoyɛ bɛba.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Wobɛfrɛ na megye wo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">wʼani begyina abɔde a wo nsa ayɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Afei wobɛkan mʼanammɔntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">na worenni me bɔne akyi.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Wɔbɛsɔ me bɔne ano wɔ kotoku mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:17">na woakata mʼamumɔyɛ so.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>“Nanso sɛnea mmepɔw so hohoro na ɛpompono</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:18">na ɔbotan nso twe fi ne sibea no,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>sɛnea nsu yiyi abo ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">na osuhweam twe dɔte kɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">saa ara na wosɛe onipa anidaso.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Wutintim ne so prɛko pɛ, na otwa mu kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">wosakra ne nipasu na wugya no kwan.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Sɛ wɔhyɛ ne mmabarima anuonyam a, onnim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">na sɛ wɔbrɛ wɔn ase a, onhu.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Ɔno ara were mu yaw na ɔtee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">na ɔno ara ne ho na ogyam.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Elifas Mmuae A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Na Temanni Elifas buae se,<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>“Enti onyansafo de nsɛm a aba biara nni mu beyi nʼano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">anaasɛ ɔde apuei mframa a emu yɛ hyew bɛhyɛ nʼafuru ma?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Ɔde nsɛm huhuw begye akyinnye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">aka nsɛm a mfaso biara nni so ana?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Wototo onyamesuro ase mmom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">na wusiw Onyankopɔn som ho kwan.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Wo bɔne kyerɛ wʼano nea ɔnka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">na woafa anitew tɛkrɛma.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Wʼankasa wʼano bu wo kumfɔ, ɛnyɛ me de;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">wʼankasa wʼano di adanse tia wo.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>“Wone onipa a wɔwoo wo dii kan ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Wɔwoo wo ansa na wɔrewo nkoko ana?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Wutie Onyankopɔn afotu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Wo nko ara na wunim nyansa ana?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Dɛn na wunim a, yennim?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Nhumu bɛn na wowɔ a yenni?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Nea wafuw dwen ne akwakoraa wɔ yɛn afa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">wɔn a wɔanyinyin sen wʼagya mpo.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Onyankopɔn awerɛkyekye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">ne nsɛm a wɔka no brɛoo kyerɛ wo no sua ma wo ana?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Adɛn nti na wo koma atwe wo akɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">adɛn nti na wʼani asɔ gya,<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>na woadan wʼabufuw agu Onyankopɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">na woma saa nsɛm yi pue fi wʼano?<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>“Ɔdesani ne hena a obetumi ayɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">anaasɛ nea ɔbea awo no bɛn na obetumi ayɛ ɔtreneeni?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Onyankopɔn nni ahotoso wɔ nʼakronkronfo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">ɔsorosoro mpo nyɛ kronkron wɔ nʼani so,<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>na me ne onipa debɔneyɛfo ne omumɔyɛfo a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">ɔnom bɔne sɛ nsu.<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>“Tie me, na mɛkyerɛ wo mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">ma menka nea mahu nkyerɛ wo,<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>nea anyansafo apae mu aka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">a wɔamfa biribiara a wonya fii wɔn agyanom hɔ no ansie<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>(wɔn nko ara na wɔde asase no maa wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">bere a ananafo biara nni wɔn mu):<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Omumɔyɛfo kɔ ahohia mu, ne nkwanna nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">na basabasayɛni nso, ne mfe a wɔahyehyɛ ama no nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Nnyigyei a ɛyɛ hu hyɛ nʼasom ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">na sɛ ɛyɛ sɛ nneɛma rekɔ yiye ma no a, akorɔmfo tow hyɛ ne so.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Ɔpa abaw sɛ obeguan afi sum mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">wɔabɔ no ato hɔ ama afoa.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Okyinkyin hwehwɛ aduan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">onim sɛ sum da no abɛn.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Ɔhaw ne ahoyeraw yi no hu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">ɛhyɛ ne so sɛ ɔhene a wasiesie ne ho ama ɔko,<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>efisɛ ɔteɛteɛ ne nsa kyerɛ Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">na ɔma ne ho so tia Otumfo,<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>wɔde nkatabo a mu piw na ɛyɛ den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">kɔ ne so a, onsuro obiara.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>“Ɛwɔ mu sɛ srade ama nʼafono atotɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">na nʼasen mu nam abubu agu so de,<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>nanso ɔbɛtena nkurow a agu so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">na watena afi a obi nte mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">afi a ɛrebubu mu.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Ɔrenkɔ so nyɛ ɔdefo bio, na nʼahonya rennyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">na nʼagyapade so bɛtew na ayera wɔ asase so.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Ɔrenguan sum no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">ogyaframa bɛhyew ne mman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">na Onyankopɔn anom ahomegu bɛsoa no akɔ.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔde ne ho to nneɛma huhuw so de daadaa ne ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">efisɛ ɔrennya hwee mfi mu.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Ansa na ne da bedu no, wobetua no ka a bi nka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">na ne mman renyɛ frɔmfrɔm.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Ɔbɛyɛ sɛ bobedua a wɔaporow so aba a ennyin ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">te sɛ ngodua a ne nhwiren reporow gu fam.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Na abɔnefo fekuw a wonnim Onyankopɔn no rensow aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">na ogya bɛhyew wɔn a wɔdɔ kɛtɛasehyɛ no ntamadan.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Wonyinsɛn ɔhaw na wɔwo bɔne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">wɔn awotwaa siesie nnaadaa.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Mmuae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Afei Hiob buae se,<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>“Mate nsɛm bebree a ɛte sɛ eyinom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">na mo nyinaa moyɛ ogyamserewfo!<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>So mo kasa tenten no remma awiei ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Dɛn na ɛhaw mo nti a mugu so regye akyinnye yi?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Anka me nso metumi akasa sɛ mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">sɛ mo na mowɔ me tebea yi mu a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">anka metumi akeka nsɛm a ɛyɛ dɛ atia mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">na mabu mo animtiaa.<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Nanso anka mɛhyɛ mo den;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">anka awerɛkyekye nsɛm a ebefi mʼanom no bɛma mo ahotɔ.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>“Nanso sɛ mekasa a ɔyaw a mete no remmrɛ ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">na sɛ mankasa nso a, ɛrennyae.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Onyankopɔn, ampa ara woama mabrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">woasɛe me fi pasaa.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Woakyekyere me, ama abɛyɛ adansedi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">me so tew ara na ɛtew na edi adanse tia me.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Onyankopɔn tow hyɛ me so tetew me wɔ nʼabufuw mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">na ɔtwɛre ne se gu me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">nea ɔne me anya no pɔkyere nʼani hwɛ me.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Nnipa bue wɔn ano di me ho fɛw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">wɔbɔ me sotɔre de bu me animtiaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">na wɔka wɔn ho bɔ mu de tia me.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Onyankopɔn de me ama abɔnefo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">watow me ato amumɔyɛfo nsam.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Na biribiara kɔ yiye ma me, nanso ɔdwerɛw me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">osoo me kɔn mu, tow me hwee hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Ɔde me asi nʼani so;<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>nʼagyantowfo atwa me ho ahyia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">ohwirew mʼasaabo mu a wanhu me mmɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">maa me bɔnwoma petee fam.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Ɔba me so bere biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">na ɔtow hyɛ me so sɛ ɔkofo.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>“Mapam atweaatam akata me were so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">na masie mʼanintɔn wɔ mfutuma mu.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Agyaadwotwa ama mʼani ayɛ kɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">sunsuma kabii atwa mʼani ho ahyia,<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>nanso me nsa nyɛɛ basabasayɛ biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">na me mpaebɔ yɛ kann.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>“Asase, nkata me mogya so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">na mma me sufrɛ to ntwa da!<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Mprempren mpo, me danseni wɔ ɔsoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">me kamafo wɔ soro hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Me dimafo yɛ mʼadamfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">bere a mʼaniwa tew nisu gu Onyankopɔn so yi;<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>ogyina onipa anan mu di ma no wɔ Onyankopɔn anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">sɛnea obi di ma nʼadamfo no.<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>“Mfe kakraa bi akyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">ansa na metu kwan akɔ koransan.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Me honhom atɔ beraw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">me nna so atwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">na ɔda retwɛn me.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Ampa ara fɛwdifo atwa me ho ahyia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">ɛsɛ sɛ mehwɛ wɔn atutuwpɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>“Ao Onyankopɔn, hyɛ me bɔ a wuhia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">Hena bio na ɔbɛma me bammɔ?<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Wɔato wɔn adwene mu a wɔnte asɛm ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">enti woremma wonni nkonim.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Sɛ obi sopa ne nnamfonom de gye akatua a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ɛbɛhwere ne mma aniwa.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>“Onyankopɔn de me ayɛ asɛm a ɛda obiara ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">obi a wɔte ntasu gu nʼani so.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Awerɛhow ama mʼani ayɛ siamoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">me nipadua nyinaa yɛ sunsuma.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Ɛyɛ atreneefo nwonwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">wɔn a wodi bem tia wɔn a wonni nyamesu.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Nanso atreneefo bɛkɔ wɔn anim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">na wɔn a wɔn nsa ho tew no bɛkɔ so anya ahoɔden.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>“Mo nyinaa monsan mmra mmɛsɔ nhwɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">Na merennya onyansafo wɔ mo mu.<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Me nna atwa mu, me nhyehyɛe apansam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">Nanso me koma apɛde<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>ma anadwo dan awia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">sum mu koraa no hann bɛn.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Sɛ ofi a mʼani da so nkutoo ne ɔda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">sɛ mesɛw me kɛtɛ wɔ sum mu,<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>sɛ meka kyerɛ porɔwee se, ‘Wo yɛ mʼagya,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">ne osunson se, ‘Me na’ anaa ‘Me nuabea’ a,<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>na afei mʼanidaso wɔ he?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Hena na obetumi anya anidaso bi ama me?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Ebesian akɔ owu pon ano ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:16">Yɛn nyinaa besian akɔ mfutuma mu ana?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildad Mmuae A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Na Suhini Bildad buae se,<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>“Bere bɛn na wubegyae kasa tenten yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Dwene ho yiye, na afei yebetumi akasa.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Adɛn nti na wofa yɛn sɛ anantwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">na wususuw sɛ yennim nyansa yi?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Wo a wode abufuw tetew wo mu nketenkete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">wo nti na yemfi asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">anaasɛ wonnwiriw abotan mfi wɔn sibea ana?<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>“Omumɔyɛfo kanea adum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">na ne gya nnɛw bio.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Hann a ɛwɔ ne ntamadan mu duru sum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">kanea a esi ne ho no dum.<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Nʼanammɔntu mu ahoɔden ano bɛbrɛ ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">nʼankasa nhyehyɛe hwe no ase.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Nʼanammɔn de no kɔ afiri mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">na okyinkyin kɔtɔ ne tan mu.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Afiri so ne nantin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">na eso ne mu dennen.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Wɔasum no afiri ahintaw wɔ fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">afiri wɔ ne kwan mu.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Ahunahuna ma ɔbɔ huboa wɔ ne ho nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">na ɛhaw no wɔ nʼanammɔntu biara mu.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Atoyerɛnkyɛm kɔn dɔ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">na sɛ ɔhwe ase a, amanehunu retwɛn no.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Ɛwewe ne honam ani baabi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">na owu di kan sɛe nʼakwaa.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Wɔtwe no fi ne ntamadan bammɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">na wɔde no brɛ ahunahunahene.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Ogya te ne ntamadan mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">na wɔabɔ sufre a ɛredɛw apete nʼatenae.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Ne ntin wuwu wɔ ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">na ne mman nso wu wɔ soro.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Wɔnnkae no asase so bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">na onni din wɔ asase so.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Wɔka no fi hann mu kɔ sum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">na wɔpam no fi wiase.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Onni mma anaa nananom wɔ ne nkurɔfo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">na nʼaseni biara renka wɔ baabi a ɔtenae.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Nnipa a wofi atɔe fam ho adwiriw wɔn wɔ nea ato no no ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">na aninyanne bunkam wɔn a wɔwɔ apuei fam no so.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Ampa ara, sɛɛ na omumɔyɛfo atenae te;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">sɛɛ ne beae a nea onnim Onyankopɔn no te.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua Bildad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Na Hiob buae se,<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>“Mobɛhyɛ me ɔyaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">na mode nsɛm abubu me akosi da bɛn?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Mpɛn du ni a moasopa me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">mo ani nwu sɛ motow hyɛ me so.<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Sɛ ɛyɛ nokware sɛ mafom ɔkwan a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">me mfomso yɛ me nko ara asɛm.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Sɛ ampa sɛ mobɛma mo ho so asen me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">na mode mʼanimguase ayɛ adanse atia me a,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>ɛno de munhu sɛ Onyankopɔn ayɛ me bɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">na ɔde ne tan atwa me ho ahyia.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>“Ɛwɔ mu, misu se, ‘Wɔafom me’ de, nanso obiara mmua me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">meteɛ mu pɛ mmoa, nanso atɛntrenee biara nni hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Wasiw me kwan enti mintumi nsen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">ɔde sum aduru mʼakwan so.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Wayi mʼanuonyam afi me so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">na watu mʼahenkyɛw afi me ti so.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Wasɛe me akwannuasa nyinaa so de awie me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">watu mʼanidaso ase te sɛ dua.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Nʼabufuw huru tia me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">na wakan me afra nʼatamfo mu.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Nʼakofo ba anibere so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">wosisi mpie de tia me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">na wotwa me ntamadan ho hyia.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>“Wayi me nuabarimanom afi me ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">na mʼamanifo atwe wɔn ho koraa.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Mʼabusuafo kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">na me nnamfonom werɛ afi me.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Mʼahɔho ne me mmaawa bu me sɛ ɔhɔho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">mete sɛ ɔnanani ma wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Mefrɛ me somfo, na ommua;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">mpo, metew mʼano srɛ no.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Me home bɔn me yere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">me ho afono mʼankasa nuabarimanom.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Mpo, mmarimaa nkumaa bu me animtiaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">sɛ mipue a wodi me ho fɛw.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Me nnamfo ankasa nyinaa kyi me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">mʼadɔfo asɔre atia me.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Maka were ne nnompe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">nea mede aguan nkutoo ne me se akyi nam.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>“Munhu me mmɔbɔ, me nnamfonom, munhu mmɔbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">na Onyankopɔn nsa abɔ me.<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Adɛn nti na motaa me sɛnea Onyankopɔn yɛ no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Na mommfa me honam yi saa ara?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>“Ao, sɛ anka wɔde me nsɛm bɛhyɛ nhoma mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">anka wɔbɛkyerɛw wɔ nhoma mmobɔwee so,<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>anka wɔde dade pɛe bɛkyerɛw wɔ sumpii so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">anaa wobekuruakyerɛw wɔ ɔbotan so afebɔɔ!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Minim sɛ me dimafo te ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">na awiei no ɔbɛsɔre agyina asase so.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Na wɔasɛe me were awie no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">mefi me were mu ahu Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Me ara mehu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">mede mʼani, na ɛnyɛ obi foforo ani, behu no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Sɛnea me koma ho pere wɔ me mu!<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>“Sɛ moka se, ‘Yɛbɛteetee no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">efisɛ ɔhaw no fi ɔno ara a,’<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mo ankasa musuro afoa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">na abufuw nam afoa so de asotwe bɛba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">na mubehu sɛ atemmu wɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Sofar Mmuae A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Na Naamani Sofar buae se,<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>Me tirim mu ntew me, na ɛhyɛ me sɛ mimmua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">efisɛ me ho yeraw me yiye.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Mate animka bi a egu me ho fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">na ntease a minya no hyɛ me sɛ mimmua.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>“Ampa ara wunim sɛnea nneɛma te fi tete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">efi bere a wɔde nnipa duaa asase so no,<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>sɛ amumɔyɛfo ani gye bere tiaa bi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">na wɔn a wonsuro nyame nso anigye nkyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Ɛwɔ mu sɛ nʼahohoahoa kodu ɔsoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">na ne ti kɔpem omununkum koraa a,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>ɔbɛyera afebɔɔ te sɛ nʼankasa nʼagyanan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">na wɔn a wohuu no no bebisa se, ‘Ɔwɔ he?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Otu kɔ te sɛ ɔdae, na wɔrenhu no bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">wɔn werɛ fi te sɛ anadwo mu anisoadehu.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Ani a ehuu no no renhu no bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">na ne sibea nso renhu no bio.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Ne mma bɛpata ahiafo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">ɛsɛ sɛ nʼankasa de nʼahonya san ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Ne mmerantebere mu ahoɔden a ahyɛ ne nnompe ma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">ne no bɛkɔ mfutuma mu.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>“Ɛwɔ mu sɛ bɔne yɛ nʼanom dɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">na ɔde sie ne tɛkrɛma ase,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>ɛwɔ mu sɛ ontumi nnyaa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">na ɔma ɛka ne dudom,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>nanso, nʼaduan bɛyɛ nwen wɔ ne yafunu mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">ɛbɛyɛ ɔwɔ ano bɔre wɔ ne mu.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Ɔbɛfe ahonyade a ɔmenee no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Onyankopɔn bɛma ne yafunu apuw agu.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Ɔbɛfefe awɔ bɔre;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">Ɔnanka se bekum no.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Ɔrennya nsuwansuwa no nnom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">nsubɔnten a nufusu ne ɛwo sen wɔ mu no.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Ɔbɛdan nea ɔbrɛ nyae no aba a ɔrenni bi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">ɔremfa nʼaguadi mu mfaso nnye nʼani.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Efisɛ ɔhyɛɛ ahiafo so ma wodii ohia buruburoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">ɔde ne nsa ato afi a ɛnyɛ ɔno na osii so.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>“Ampa ara ɔrennya ahomegye mfi nea wapere anya no mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">ɔrentumi mfa nʼademude nnye ne ho nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Wafom nneɛma nyinaa awie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">ne nkɔso nnu baabiara.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Nʼadedodow nyinaa mu no, ɔbɛkɔ ɔhaw mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">na amanehunu a emu yɛ den bɛto no.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Bere a nʼafuru ayɛ ma no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Onyankopɔn bɛtɔ nʼabufuw gya agu ne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">na wabobɔ no basabasa.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Ɛwɔ mu sɛ oguan fi dade akode ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">nanso bɛmma a ano yɛ kɔbere mfrafrae bɛwɔ no.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Ɔtwe bɛmma no fi nʼakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">ano hyɛnhyɛn no fi ne brɛbo mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Ehu bɛba ne so;<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>sum kabii retwɛn nʼademude.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Ogya a ɛnnɛw mu bɛhyew no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">na asɛe nea aka wɔ ne ntamadan mu.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Ɔsoro bɛda nʼafɔdi adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">na asase asɔre atia no.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Nsuyiri bɛtwe ne fi akɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">saa ara na asuworo bɛyɛ Onyankopɔn abufuwhyew da no.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Eyi ne nkrabea a Onyankopɔn de ma amumɔyɛfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">agyapade a Onyankopɔn de ato hɔ ama wɔn ne no.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Na Hiob buae se,<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>Muntie me nsɛm no yiye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">Momma eyi nyɛ awerɛkyekye a mode ma me.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Munnya ntoboase mma me bere a merekasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">na sɛ mekasa wie a, monkɔ so nni fɛw.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>“Minwiinwii hyɛ onipa ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ minya ntoboase?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Monhwɛ me, na mo ho nnwiriw mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">momfa mo nsa nkata mo ano.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Sɛ midwen eyi ho a, mebɔ hu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">na me ho popo.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Adɛn nti na amumɔyɛfo tena nkwa mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">Wonyin kyɛ na wɔkɔ so di tumi.<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Wohu wɔn mma a atwa wɔn ho ahyia no nkɔso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">wohu wɔn nenanom.<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Ɔhaw nni wɔn afi mu, na ehu nni hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Onyankopɔn asotwe mma wɔn so.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Wɔn anantwinini nnyɛ asaadwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">na wɔn anantwibere nwo a wɔmpɔn.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Wɔka wɔn mma bɔ mu te sɛ nguankuw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">na emu mmotafowa no huruhuruw.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Wɔto nnwom wɔ akasae ne sanku so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">na wɔde atɛntɛbɛn nnyigyei gye wɔn ani.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Wodi yiye wɔn nkwanna mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">na wɔkɔ ɔdae mu asomdwoe mu.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>Nanso wɔka kyerɛ Onyankopɔn se, ‘Fi yɛn so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">Yɛmpɛ sɛ yehu wʼakwan.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>Hena ne otumfo no a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛsom no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Sɛ yɛbɔ no mpae a mfaso bɛn na yebenya?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Nanso wɔn nkɔso no nni wɔn nsam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">enti metwe me ho fi amumɔyɛfo afotu ho.<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>“Nanso mpɛn ahe na wodum amumɔyɛfo kanea?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Mpɛn ahe na amanehunu ba wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">nea Onyankopɔn fi nʼabufuw mu de ba no?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Mpɛn ahe na wɔyɛ sɛ sare wɔ mframa ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">te sɛ ntɛtɛ a mframaden bi apra wɔn?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Wɔka se, ‘Onyankopɔn kora onipa asotwe so de twɛn ne mma.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔtwe onipa no ankasa aso ma ohu.<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Ma ɔno ankasa ani nhu ne sɛe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">ma Otumfo abufuwhyew no nka nʼani.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Dɛn na ɛfa wɔn ho fa wɔn abusuafo a woagyaw wɔn akyi no ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">bere a asram a wɔatwa ama no aba awiei no?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>“Obi betumi akyerɛ Onyankopɔn nyansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">wɔ bere a obu atitiriw mpo atɛn?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Obi wu wɔ bere a ɔwɔ ahoɔden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">ne ho tɔ no na nʼaso mu adwo no,<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>na ne nipadua ayɛ frɔmfrɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">na hon ahyɛ ne nnompe ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Ɔfoforo nso de ɔkra mu yawdi wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">a wanka asetena pa anhwɛ da.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Wosie wɔn nyinaa wɔ mfutuma koro mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">ma asunson nnunu wɔn nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>“Mahu mo adwene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">ɔkwan a mobɛfa so afom me.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Moka se, ‘Onipa kɛse no fi wɔ he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">ntamadan a omumɔyɛfo no tenaa mu no?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>So mummmisaa wɔn a wotu kwan no asɛm da?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Wɔn amanneɛbɔ mu nsɛm ho nhiaa mo<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>sɛ onipa bɔne nya ne ti didi mu amanehunu da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">na wogye wɔn abufuwhyew da no ana?<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Hena na ɔde ne suban si nʼanim?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Hena na otua no nea wayɛ so ka?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Wɔsoa no kɔ ɔda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">na wɔwɛn nʼaboda.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Obon mu dɔte yɛ no dɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">nnipa nyinaa di nʼakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">na dɔm a wontumi nkan wɔn di nʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>“Enti ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na mode mo nsɛnhunu bɛkyekye me werɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Mo mmuae nyɛ hwee sɛ atoro!”<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Elifas Mmuae A Ɛto So Abien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Na Temanni Elifas buae se,<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>“Onyankopɔn benya onipa so mfaso ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Mpo onyansafo so bɛba no mfaso ana?<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Sɛ woyɛ ɔtreneeni a, anigye bɛn na Otumfo no benya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Sɛ wʼakwan ho nni asɛm a, mfaso bɛn na obenya?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>“Wo kronkronyɛ nti na ɔka wʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">na ɔbɔ wo kwaadu ana?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>Ɛnyɛ wʼamumɔyɛ na ɛso?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Ɛnyɛ wo bɔne na ɛdɔɔso dodo?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Wopɛɛ bammɔ fii wo nuanom nkyɛn a emfi hwee so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">wopaa nnipa ho ntama ma wɔdaa adagyaw.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Woamma abrɛfo nsu annom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">na wode aduan kamee nea ɔkɔm de no,<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>nanso na woyɛ obi a ɔwɔ tumi, wɔ nsase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">onuonyamfo a ɔte so.<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Wopam akunafo ma wɔkɔɔ nsapan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">na womaa ayisaa nso ahoɔden sae.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Ɛno nti na mfiri atwa wo ho ahyia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">na amanehunu a ɛba ntɛm so bɔ wo hu yi,<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>ɛno nti na sum kabii aduru a wunhu ade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">na asorɔkye akata wo so yi.<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>“So Onyankopɔn nni ɔsoro akyirikyiri ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Hwɛ sɛnea ɔsoro akyirikyiri nsoromma korɔn!<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Nanso woka se, ‘Dɛn na Onyankopɔn nim?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Sum yi mu na obu atɛn ana?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Omununkum kabii akata nʼanim nti onhu yɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">bere a ɔnenam ɔsoro kontonkurowi mu.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>So wobɛkɔ so afa ɔkwan dedaw a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">abɔnefo anantew so no so ana?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Wɔpraa wɔn kɔe ansa na wɔn bere reso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">na nsuyiri hohoroo wɔn fapem.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Na wɔka kyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn se, ‘Gyaa yɛn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">Dɛn na Otumfo betumi ayɛ yɛn?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Nanso ɛyɛ ɔno na ɔde nnepa hyɛɛ wɔn afi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">nti metwe me ho fi amumɔyɛfo afotu ho.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Atreneefo hu wɔn asehwe ma wɔn ani gye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">na wɔn a wɔn ho nni asɛm serew wɔn ka se,<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‘Wɔasɛe yɛn atamfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">na ogya ahyew wɔn agyapade.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>“Fa wo ho ma Onyankopɔn na nya asomdwoe wɔ ne mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">saa ɔkwan yi so na yiyedi bɛfa ayɛ wo kyɛfa.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Tie akwankyerɛ a efi nʼanom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">na fa ne nsɛm sie wo koma mu.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Sɛ wosan kɔ Otumfo no nkyɛn a obegye wo ato mu bio:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">sɛ wuyi amumɔyɛsɛm fi wo ntamadan mu<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>na wotow wo sika mpɔw gu mfutuma mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">ne Ofir sikakɔkɔɔ gu abotan a ɛwɔ abon mu no so a,<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>ɛno de Otumfo bɛyɛ wo sikakɔkɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">ɔbɛyɛ dwetɛ ankasa ama wo.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Afei nokware wubenya anigye wɔ Otumfo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">na wobɛpagyaw wʼani akyerɛ Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Wobɛbɔ no mpae, na obetie wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">na wubedi wo bɔhyɛ so.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Nea woyɛ wʼadwene sɛ wobɛyɛ no bɛba mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">na hann bɛtɔ wʼakwan so.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Sɛ nnipa hwe ase na woka se, ‘Ma wɔn so!’ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">obegye wɔn a wɔahwe ase no nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Obegye abɔnefo mpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">ɔnam wo nsa a ɛho nni fi so begye wɔn.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Mmuae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Na Hiob buae se,<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>“Nnɛ mpo, mʼanwiinwii mu da so yɛ den;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">ne nsa ayɛ den, mʼapinisi nyinaa akyi.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Sɛ minim baabi a mehu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">anaasɛ metumi akɔ ne tenabea a<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>anka mɛka mʼasɛm wɔ nʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">na magye akyinnye bebree.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Anka mɛte mmuae a ɔde bɛma me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:5">na madwen nea ɔbɛka ho.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Ɔbɛsɔre atia me dennen ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Dabi, ɔremmɔ me kwaadu.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Ɛhɔ de, nnipa trenee betumi aka nʼasɛm wɔ nʼanim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">na wobegye me afi me temmufo nsam afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>“Nanso sɛ mekɔ apuei fam a onni hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">sɛ mekɔ atɔe fam nso a minhu no.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Sɛ ɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ atifi fam a minhu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">sɛ ɔdan ne ho kɔ anafo fam a, mʼani nhye ne ho.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Nanso onim ɔkwan a menam so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">na sɛ ɔsɔ me hwɛ a mepue sɛ sikakɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Madi nʼanammɔn akyi pɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">na manantew nʼakwan so a mamman.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Mentwee me ho mfii mmara nsɛm a efi nʼanom no ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">mama asɛm a efi nʼanom ho ahia me asen me daa aduan.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>“Nanso obiara nni hɔ ka ne ho, na hena na obetumi atia no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Ɔyɛ biribiara a ɔpɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Ɔde ne mmaransɛm di dwuma tia me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">ɔda so kora nhyehyɛe a ɛte sɛɛ bebree.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Ɛno nti na mebɔ hu wɔ nʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">na sɛ midwen eyinom nyinaa ho a, misuro no.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Onyankopɔn ama me koma abotow;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Otumfo ama mabɔ huboa.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Nanso sum no mma menka mʼano nto mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">sum kabii a ɛkata mʼanim no.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>“Adɛn nti na Onyankopɔn nhyɛ bere mma atemmu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Adɛn nti na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔn a wonim no no hwɛ saa da no anim nanso ɛmma da?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Nnipa yiyi abo a wɔde ato ɔhye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">na wɔde nguankuw a wɔawia kɔ hɔ adidi.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Wɔpam ayisaa mfurum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">na wogye akunafo anantwi sɛ awowaside.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Wosum ahiafo fi kwan so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">na wɔhyɛ asase no so ahiafo ma wɔkɔtetɛw.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Sɛnea sare so mfurum yɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">saa ara na ahiafo no yɛ wɔn adwuma de pɛ aduan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">asase kesee no so na wonya aduan ma wɔn mma.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Wɔboaboa mmoa aduan ano wɔ mfuw no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">na wodi mpɛpɛ wɔ amumɔyɛfo bobe nturo mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Wonni ntama, na wɔda adagyaw anadwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">wonni hwee a wɔde kata wɔn ho wɔ awɔw mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Mmepɔw so osu tɔ fɔw wɔn kyam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">na wɔtetare abotan no ho, efisɛ wonni nnae.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Wɔtew ayisaa fi nufu ano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">na wɔfa ohiani abotafowa de si ne ka anan mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Wɔnenam adagyaw a wonni ntama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">wɔsoa awi afiafi, nanso ɔkɔm de wɔn ara.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Wokyi ngo wɔn adan mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">wotiatia nsakyiamoa mu, nanso osukɔm de wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Wɔn a wɔrewuwu no apinisi fi kuropɔn no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">na apirafo kra su pɛ mmoa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Nanso Onyankopɔn mfa bɔne nto obiara so.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>“Ebinom wɔ hɔ a wɔsɔre tia hann no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">wɔn a wonnim nʼakwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">anaasɛ wɔnnantew nʼatempɔn so no.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Sɛ adekyee hann no kɔ a, owudifo no sɔre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">na okum ohiani ne mmɔborɔni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">anadwo, mu owiawia ne ho sɛ ɔkorɔmfo.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Ɔwaresɛefo twɛn bere a anim rebiribiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">ɔka se, ‘obiara renhu me,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">na ɔde nʼanim hintaw.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Sum mu na nnipa bubu apon wura afi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">na adekyee, wɔtoto wɔn ho apon mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">wɔne hann nni hwee yɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Sum kabii yɛ adekyee ma wɔn nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">wɔne sum mu nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu fa nnamfo.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>“Nanso wɔte sɛ ahuru a ɛte nsu ani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">wɔadome wɔn kyɛfa wɔ asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">enti obiara nkɔ bobe nturo no mu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Sɛnea ɔhyew ne ɔpɛ hwim sukyerɛmma a anan kɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">saa ara na ɔda de wɔn a wɔayɛ bɔne kɔ ne no.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Awotwaa werɛ fi wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">na osunson di wɔn nam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">nnipa bɔne de wɔnnkae wɔn bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">na mmom wobubu te sɛ dua.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Wɔde ɔbea bonin a onni ba yɛ hanam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">na wonhu akunafo mmɔbɔ.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Onyankopɔn nam ne tumi so twe atumfo kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">ɛwɔ mu sɛ wonya asetena pa de, nanso wonni nkwa ho bɔhyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Otumi ma wɔn tena ase asomdwoe mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">nanso nʼani wɔ wɔn akwan so.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Wɔma wɔn so bere tiaa bi, na afei wonni hɔ bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">wɔbrɛ wɔn ase boaboa wɔn ano sɛ nnipa nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">wotwitwa wɔn gu te sɛ aburow ti.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>“Sɛ eyi nte saa a, hena na obetumi agye me akyinnye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">na ama nea maka no ayɛ nsɛnhunu?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildad Mmuae A Ɛto So Abiɛsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Na Suhini Bildad buae se,<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>“Tumi ne suro wɔ Onyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">ɔno na ɔhyehyɛ pɛpɛyɛ wɔ ɔsorosoro.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Wobetumi akan nʼakofo ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Hena na ne hann nhyerɛn wɔ ne so?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Ɛno de, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ɔdesani betumi ateɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn anim?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na nea ɔbea awo no no bɛyɛ kronn?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Mpo sɛ ɔsram nhyerɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">na nsoromma nyɛ kronn wɔ nʼani so a,<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>na nkantom onipa a ɔte sɛ nsaammoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">onipa ba a ɔyɛ osunson bi kɛkɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Kyerɛ Nyankopɔn Kɛseyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Na Hiob kasaa bio se,<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>“Woaboa nea onni tumi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Woagye basa a enni ahoɔden!<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Woatu nea onnim nyansa fo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Na woada nhumu pa ara adi!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Hena na ɔboaa wo ma wokaa saa nsɛm yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Hena honhom na ɛkasa faa wo mu?<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>“Awufo wɔ ahoyeraw kɛse mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">wɔn a wɔwɔ nsu ase ne nea ɛte mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Asaman da adagyaw Onyankopɔn anim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">Ɔsɛe nso nni nkataso.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Ɔtrɛw wim atifi fam kata nea ɛda mpan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">na ɔde asase sensɛn ohunu so.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Ɔbɔ nsu boa hyɛ ne omununkum mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">nanso nsu no mu duru ntumi mpae no.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Ɔtrɛw ne omununkum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">de kata ɔsram ani.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Ɔhyɛ agyirae wɔ nsu so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">de to ɔhye wɔ hann ne sum ntam.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Ɔsoro nnyinaso wosow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">na nʼanimka ma wɔn ho dwiriw wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Ɔde ne tumi wosow po</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">ne nyansa mu, otwitwaa Rahab mu asinasin.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Ɔde ne home maa wim tewee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">na ne nsa wɔɔ ɔwɔ a ɔrewea.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Eyinom yɛ ne nnwuma kakraa bi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">ne tumi kakraa bi kɛkɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Na hena na obetumi ate ne tumi mmubomu no ase?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Hiob toaa nʼasɛm so se,<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>“Sɛ Onyankopɔn te ase yi, nea wammu me atɛntrenee no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">Otumfo a wama madi me kra mu awerɛhow,<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>mmere dodow a nkwa wɔ me mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">na Onyankopɔn home wɔ me mu yi,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>mʼano renka amumɔyɛsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">na me tɛkrɛma rentwa nkontompo.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Merennye nto mu da sɛ nea woka no yɛ nokware;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">merenka me mudi nhyɛ, kosi sɛ mewu.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Mekura me trenee mu, merennyaa mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">sɛ mete ase yi, me tiboa remmu me fɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>“Ma mʼatamfo nyɛ sɛ amumɔyɛfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">na wɔn a wokyi me nyɛ sɛ atorofo.<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Anidaso bɛn na wɔn a wonni nyamesu no wɔ wɔ wɔn wu akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">bere a Onyankopɔn agye wɔn nkwa afi wɔn nsam no?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>So Onyankopɔn tie wɔn sufrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">bere a amanehunu aba wɔn so no ana?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>So wɔn ani begye wɔ Otumfo no mu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Wobesu afrɛ Onyankopɔn bere biara ana?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>“Mɛma mo Onyankopɔn tumi ho nkyerɛkyerɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">meremfa Otumfo no akwan nhintaw.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Mo ankasa moahu eyinom nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">Afei nsɛnhunu yi ase ne dɛn?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>“Eyi ne nea Onyankopɔn ahyɛ ato hɔ ama omumɔyɛfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">agyapade a otirimɔdenfo nya fi Otumfo no nkyɛn:<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Sɛ ɔwɔ mma dodow dɛn ara, wɔn nkrabea ne afoa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">na nʼasefo rennidi mmee da.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Ɔyaredɔm besie wɔn a wɔbɛka wɔ nʼakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">na wɔn akunafo rensu wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Ɛwɔ mu sɛ ɔhɔre dwetɛ te sɛ mfutuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">na ɔboa ntama ano sɛ dɔte,<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>nea ɔpɛ gu hɔ no, atreneefo na wobefura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">na pɛpɛyɛfo no nso akyekyɛ dwetɛ no.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Ofi a osi no te sɛ ananse abubummaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">ɛte sɛ pata bi a ɔwɛmfo abɔ.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Ɔda hɔ te sɛ ɔdefo, nanso ɔrenna saa bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">ɔbɛtew nʼani no na ne nyinaa atu ayera.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Ahunahuna ba ne so sɛ nsuyiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">ahum hwim no kɔ anadwo.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Apuei mframa soa no kɔ, na onni hɔ bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">ɛtwe no fi ne tenabea.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Ɛbɔ no a ahummɔbɔ nni mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">bere a ɔreguan afi ne tumi ase.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Ɔde fɛw bɔ ne nsam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">na ɔpam no fi ne tenabea.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>“Beae a wotu dwetɛ wɔ hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">ne beae a wɔnan sika kɔkɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Wotu dade fi fam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">na wɔnan kɔbere fi dadebo mu.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Onipa ma sum ba awiei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">na ɔhwehwɛ kɔ akyirikyiri asase mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">kɔhwehwɛ dadebo wɔ sum kabii mu.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Wɔde fagudetu afiri hyɛ beae a ɛmmɛn ɔdesani atenae,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">mmeae a nnipa anan nsii hɔ da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">baabi a ɛmmɛn nnipa no, ɛhɔ na wodi aforosian.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Asase a ɛbɔ aduan no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">wɔdan ase no te sɛ nea wɔde ogya na ayɛ;<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>hoabo fi nʼabotan mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">na sikakɔkɔɔ mpɔw nso wɔ ne mfutuma mu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Ɔkɔre biara nnim saa kwan a ahintaw no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">akoroma biara ani nhuu ɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Mmoa ahantanfo nsi hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">na gyata nkɔdɛɛdɛɛ wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Onipa nsa paapae abotan dennen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">na ɔma mmepɔw ase da hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Otwa aka fa abotan mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">na ohu nʼademude nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Ɔhwehwɛ baabi a nsubɔnten ti wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">na ɔda nneɛma a ahintaw adi.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>“Nanso ɛhe na yebehu nea nyansa hyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Ɛhe na ntease te?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Onipa renhu ne bo a ɛsom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">wɔrenhu wɔ ateasefo asase so.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Na ebun ka se, ‘Enni me mu’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">na po nso se, ‘Enni me nkyɛn.’<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Wɔrentumi mfa sikakɔkɔɔ ankasa ntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">na wɔrentumi mfa dwetɛ nkari ne bo.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Wɔrentumi mfa Ofir sikakɔkɔɔ ntɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">apopobibiribo anaa hoabo nso saa ara.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Wɔrentumi mfa ahwehwɛ anaa sikakɔkɔɔ ntoto ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">na wɔrentumi mfa sikakɔkɔɔ nnwinne nsesa.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛbɔ ahene panyin ne ahwehwɛbo din;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">nyansa bo sen nhene pa.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Etiopia akraatebo ne no nsɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">wɔrentumi mfa sikakɔkɔɔ kronkron ntɔ.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>“Ɛno de, na ɛhe na nyansa fi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Ɛhe na ntease te?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Wɔde asie abɔde biara ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">wɔde asie wim nnomaa mpo.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Ɔsɛe ne Owu ka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Yɛate no huhuhuhu kɛkɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Onyankopɔn te ɔkwan a ɛkɔ hɔ ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">na ɔno nko ara na onim faako a ɛte,<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>efisɛ ɔhwɛ kodu nsase ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">na ohu biribiara a ɛwɔ ɔsoro ase.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Bere a ɔhyɛɛ mframa ano den too hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">na osusuw nsuwa no,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>bere a ɔkaa no ɔhyɛ so kyerɛɛ osutɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">na otwaa kwan maa aprannaa no,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>afei ɔhwɛɛ nyansa na ɔkarii no hwɛe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">na ogyee no too mu na ɔsɔɔ no hwɛe.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ onipa se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> suro, ɛno ne nyansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">na sɛ wokyi bɔne, yɛ ntease.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Hiob toaa so se,<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>“Mʼani agyina asram a atwa mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">nna a Onyankopɔn hwɛɛ me so no,<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>bere a ne kanea hyerɛn mʼatifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">na mede ne kanea nantewee sum mu no!<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>Ao, nna a misii so no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">bere a Onyankopɔn adamfofa a emu yɛ den hyiraa me fi,<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>bere a na Otumfo no da so ka me ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">na me mma atwa me ho ahyia no,<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>bere a na nufusu mu srade afɔw mʼakwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">na abotan hwiee ngo sɛ nsu maa me no.<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>“Bere a na mekɔ kuropɔn pon ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">mekɔtena mʼagua so wɔ ɔmanfo aguabɔbea,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>mmerante hu me a, wogyina nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">na mpanyimfo sɔre gyina hɔ;<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>atitiriw gyae kasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">na wɔde wɔn nsa kata wɔn ano;<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>mmapɔmma tɛm dinn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">na wɔn tɛkrɛma ka wɔn dudom.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Wɔn a wɔte me nka nyinaa ka me ho asɛmpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">na wɔn a wohu me nyinaa kamfo me,<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>efisɛ meboaa ahiafo a wosu pɛɛ mmoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ne ayisaa a wonni aboafo.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Onipa a na ɔrewu no hyiraa me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">na memaa akunafo ani gyee wɔn koma mu.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Mede trenee furaa sɛ mʼadurade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">atɛntrenee yɛɛ me nkataso ne mʼabotiri.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Meyɛɛ aniwa maa anifuraefo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">ne anan maa mmubuafo.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Meyɛɛ ahiafo agya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">na mekaa ahɔho asɛm maa wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Mibubuu amumɔyɛfo se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">na mihwim wɔn a wodi wɔn nya no fii wɔn anom.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>“Medwenee sɛ, ‘Mewu wɔ mʼankasa me fi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">na me nna dɔɔso sɛ nwea.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Me ntin beduu nsu ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">na obosu agugu me mman so anadwo mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Mʼanuonyam rempa da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">na agyan ayɛ foforo wɔ me nsam daa.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>“Nnipa hwehwɛɛ sɛ wotie me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">wɔyɛɛ dinn, twɛn mʼafotu.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Sɛ mekasa wie a wɔnnkasa bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">efisɛ me nsɛm tɔɔ wɔn asom yiye.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Wɔtwɛn me sɛnea wɔtwɛn osu a ɛpete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">na wɔmenee me nsɛm sɛ osutɔ bere nsu.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Sɛ meserew mekyerɛ wɔn a, wɔntaa nnye nni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">mʼanimtew som bo ma wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Mebɔɔ kwan maa wɔn na metenaa ase sɛ wɔn hene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">metenaa ase sɛ ɔhene a ɔwɔ nʼasraafo mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">meyɛɛ sɛ obi a ɔkyekye agyaadwotwafo werɛ.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>“Nanso mprempren wɔserew me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">nnipa a manyin sen wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">na wɔn agyanom mfata sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">wɔne me nguan ho akraman tena.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Mfaso bɛn na wɔn nsa mu ahoɔden wɔ ma me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">bere a wɔn ahoɔden afi wɔn mu?<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Ohia ne ɔkɔm ama wɔn ho atetew,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">wɔnantew asase kesee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">ne asase bonin so anadwo.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Wɔboaboaa nkyenhaban ano wɔ nkyɛkyerɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">na wɔde sare so nnua ntin yɛɛ wɔn aduan.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Wɔn mfɛfo pam wɔn fii wɔn mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">na wohuroo wɔn sɛ akorɔmfo.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Wɔhyɛɛ wɔn ma wɔtenaa suka a emu awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">abotan ne fam ntokuru mu,<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>wosuu sɛ mfurum wɔ wuram</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">na wɔfofɔree so wɔ ɔdɔtɔ ase.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Kuw a wɔmfra na wonni din,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">wɔpam wɔn fii asase no so.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>“Na nnɛ yi wɔn mmabarima de dwom bɔ me akutia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">mayɛ abusude wɔ wɔn mu.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Wokyi me na wontwiw mmɛn me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">wɔmmfɛre sɛ wɔtete ntasu gu mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Afei a Onyankopɔn abubu me tadua na ɔde amanehunu aba me so yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">wɔyɛ nea wɔpɛ wɔ mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Abusuakuw no tow hyɛ me so wɔ me nifa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">wosum mʼanan mfiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">na wosisi mpie tia me.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Wosisiw mʼakwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">na wonya me sɛe me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">na obiara mmoa me.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Wɔba te sɛ nea wofi ntokuru a ano abae mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">wɔnam mmubui no mu munumunum ba.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Ahunahuna ma me ho dwiriw me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">mʼanuonyam atu kɔ sɛnea mframa abɔ agu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">me bammɔ atu ayera sɛ omununkum.<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>“Na mprempren, me nkwa resa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">na amanehununna akyekyere me.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Anadwo wowɔ me nnompe mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">ɔyaw a ɛwe me no nnyae.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Onyankopɔn fi ne tumi mu yɛ sɛ adurade ma me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">omia me te sɛ mʼatade kɔn.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Ɔtow me kyene dontori mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">na ɔma me yɛ sɛ mfutuma ne nsõ.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>“Onyankopɔn, misu mefrɛ wo, nanso wummua me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">Mesɔre gyina, nanso wohwɛ me kɛkɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Woba me so anibere so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">wode wʼabasa mu tumi tow hyɛ me so.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Wuhwim me na wode mframa pia me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">wudenkyidenkyi me wɔ ahum mu.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Minim sɛ wode me bɛkɔ owu mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">faako a woahyɛ ama ateasefo nyinaa no.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>“Ampa ara obiara mfa ne nsa nka onipa a ɔrebrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">bere a ɔresu pɛ mmoa wɔ nʼamanehunu mu.<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Mansu amma wɔn a wɔwɔ ɔhaw mu ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Me kra werɛ anhow amma ahiafo ana?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Nanso bere a mʼani da papa so no, bɔne bae;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">bere a mepɛɛ hann no sum na edurui.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Me yafunu mu a ɛwowɔ me no nnyae da;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">na nna a amanehunu wɔ mu da mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Menenam a mabiri, nanso ɛnyɛ sɛ owia na ahyew me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">migyina aguabɔbea na misu pɛ mmoa.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Madan nnompo nuabarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">me ne mpatu na ɛbɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Me honam ani biri na ehuanhuan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">atiridii ama me ho adɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Me sanku bɔ kwadwom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">na mʼatɛntɛbɛn ma agyaadwotwa nnyigyei.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>“Me ne mʼani yɛɛ apam sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">meremfi akɔnnɔ mu, nhwɛ ababaa.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Dɛn ne onipa kyɛfa a efi ɔsoro Nyankopɔn nkyɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">Dɛn ne nʼagyapade a efi ɔsoro Tumfo no nkyɛn?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Ɛnyɛ ɔsɛe mma amumɔyɛfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">atoyerɛnkyɛm mma wɔn a wɔyɛ bɔne ana?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Onhu mʼakwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">na ɔnkan anammɔn biara a mitu ana?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>“Sɛ manantew wɔ nkontompo mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">anaasɛ matu mmirika adi nnaadaasɛm akyi a,<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>ma Onyankopɔn nkari me wɔ nsania papa so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">na obehu sɛ me ho nni asɛm;<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>sɛ mʼanammɔntu afom ɔkwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">sɛ me koma adi mʼani akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">anaasɛ me nsa ho agu fi a<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>ɛno de ma afoforo nni nea madua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">na ma wontutu me nnɔbae ngu.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>“Sɛ ɔbea bi atɔ me koma so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">anaasɛ matɛw me yɔnko bi pon akyi a,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>ɛno de, me yere nyam ɔbarima foforo aduan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">na mmarima afoforo ne no nna.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Efisɛ anka ɛno na ɛbɛyɛ aniwusɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">ne bɔne a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwe aso wɔ so.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Ɛyɛ ogya a ɛhyew kodu Ɔsɛe mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">na ebetumi atutu me nnɔbae ase.<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>“Sɛ mabu mʼasomfo mmarima ne mmea ntɛnkyew,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">bere a wɔne me nyaa asɛm,<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>sɛ Onyankopɔn de si mʼanim a dɛn na mɛyɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Sɛ wɔfrɛ me akontaabu a, mmuae bɛn na mɛma?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Ɛnyɛ nea ɔbɔɔ me wɔ ɔyafunu mu no na ɔbɔɔ wɔn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Ɛnyɛ onipa koro no na ɔyɛɛ yɛn baanu wɔ yɛn nanom yafunu mu?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>“Sɛ mamma ahiafo nea wɔn koma pɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">anaa mama akunafo ani ayɛ wɔn yaw,<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>sɛ mabɔ mʼaduan ho atirimɔden a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">mamma ayisaa bi,<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>nanso efi mmerantebere mu matetew no sɛnea agya bɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">na efi ɔyafunu mu, mahwɛ akunafo.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Sɛ mahu obi a onni adurade na ɔrebrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">anaa ohiani bi a onni atade,<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>na sɛ wɔamfi koma mu anhyira me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">sɛ mede me nguan ho nwi kaa wɔn hyew,<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>sɛ mama me nsa so atia ayisaa bi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">esiane sɛ mewɔ tumi wɔ asennii nti a,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>ɛno de, ma me basa mpan mfi me mmati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">ma emmubu mfi nʼapɔw so.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Misuroo ɔsɛe a efi Onyankopɔn nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">na nʼanuonyam ho suro nti mantumi anyɛ saa nneyɛe no.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>“Sɛ mede me werɛ ahyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">anaasɛ maka akyerɛ sikakɔkɔɔ ankasa se, ‘Wo na wobɔ me ho ban,’<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>sɛ masɛpɛw me ho wɔ mʼahode bebrebe nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">ahode a me nsa aka yi,<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>sɛ mahwɛ owia ne ne hyerɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">anaa ɔsram a ɔnam anuonyam mu,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>ama aka me koma a obiara nnim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">na me nsa yɛɛ wɔn atuu de nidi maa wɔn a,<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>ɛno de, na eyinom nso bɛyɛ bɔne a wobu ho atɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">efisɛ na manni Onyankopɔn a ɔte ɔsoro no nokware.<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>“Sɛ mʼani gyee wɔ me tamfo amanehunu nti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">anaa mesrew no wɔ ɔhaw a aba ne so nti,<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>memmaa mʼano nyɛɛ bɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">sɛ mɛdome ne nkwa,<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>sɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ me fi mu nkaa da sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‘Hena na Hiob pon so nam mmee no da?’<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Ɔhɔho biara anna abɔnten so da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">efisɛ me pon ano daa hɔ da biara maa akwantufo,<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Makata me bɔne so sɛnea nnipa yɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">de mʼafɔdi ahyɛ me koma mu<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>esiane sɛ misuroo nnipadɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">ne ahohora a efi mmusua hɔ no nti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">na meyɛɛ komm a mamfi adi.<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>(“Ao, sɛ anka mewɔ obi a obetie me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Mede me din ahyɛ mʼanoyi ase, ma Otumfo no mmua me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">ma nea ɔbɔ me kwaadu no nkyerɛw ne sobobɔ.<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Ampa ara, mɛhyɛ wɔ me mmati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">mɛhyɛ sɛ ahenkyɛw.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Mebu mʼanammɔntu biara ho akontaa akyerɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">mɛkɔ nʼanim sɛ ɔheneba.)<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>“Sɛ mʼasase teɛ mu tia me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">na nusu fɔw ne nkɔ nyinaa,<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>sɛ madi so aba a mintuaa ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">anaasɛ mabu so apaafo no aba mu a,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>ma nsɔe mfifi nsi awi anan mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">na wura mfuw nsi atoko anan mu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Hiob nsɛm no asi.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Elihu Adwenkyerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Enti saa mmarima baasa yi ammua Hiob bio, efisɛ na ɔteɛ wɔ ɔno ara ani so. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Na Busini Barakel babarima Elihu a ofi Ram abusua mu no bo fuw Hiob yiye sɛ obu ne ho bem na ommu Onyankopɔn mmom bem. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Ne bo fuw nnamfonom baasa no sɛ wɔantumi anya nnyinaso bi ammɔ Hiob nsɛm no angu, nanso wobuu no fɔ. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Elihu twɛn sɛ afoforo no bɛkasa akyerɛ Hiob, efisɛ na wɔanyinyin sen no. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Na ohuu sɛ nnipa baasa no nni asɛm biara ka bio no, nʼabufuw no sɔree.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Enti Busini Barakel babarima Elihu kae se,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Meyɛ abofra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">na moyɛ mpanyimfo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">ɛno nti na misuroo sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">mɛka nea minim akyerɛ mo.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Medwenee sɛ, ‘Ɛsɛ sɛ mpanyimfo kasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">ɛsɛ sɛ wɔn a wɔn ani afi kyerɛ nyansa.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Nanso honhom a ɛte onipa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">Otumfo no home no na ɛma ntease.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Ɛnyɛ mpanyimfo nko na wɔyɛ anyansafo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">ɛnyɛ wɔn a wɔn ani afi nko na wɔte nea eye ase.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>“Enti mise: Muntie me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">me nso mɛka mʼadwene.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Metwɛn wɔ bere a na morekasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">mitiee mo adwenkyerɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">bere a na munhu nea monka no,<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>meyɛɛ aso maa mo pa ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">nanso mo mu biara antumi ankyerɛ sɛ Hiob ayɛ mfomso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">mo mu biara anyi ne nsɛm no ano.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Monnka se, ‘Yɛahu nyansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">momma Onyankopɔn mmɔ nʼasɛm no ngu, na ɛnyɛ onipa.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Nanso Hiob nkasa ntia me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">na merennyina mo adwenkyerɛ so mmua no.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>“Wɔn ho adwiriw wɔn, wonni hwee ka bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">wɔn nsɛm asa.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>So ɛsɛ sɛ metwɛn wɔ bere a wɔayɛ komm yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">saa bere yi a wogyinagyina ha yi a wonni mmuae biara no?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Me nso mɛka bi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">me nso mɛka mʼadwene.<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Efisɛ nsɛm ahyɛ mʼanom ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">na honhom a ɛte me mu no hyɛ me sɛ menka;<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Me mu no, mete sɛ nsa a ɛhyɛ toa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">te sɛ nsa kotoku foforo a ɛrebɛpae.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mekasa na me ho tɔ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">ɛsɛ sɛ mibue mʼano na mema mmuae.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Merenyɛ nhwɛanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">na merennɛfɛdɛfɛ obiara;<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>na sɛ makwadaw adɛfɛdɛfɛ mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">anka me Yɛfo beyi me afi hɔ ntɛm so.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>“Na afei, Hiob, tie me nsɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">yɛ aso ma biribiara a mɛka.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Merebebue mʼano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">me nsɛm aba me tɛkrɛma so.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Me nsɛm fi koma a ɛteɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">na mʼano de ahonim pa ka nea minim.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Onyankopɔn Honhom na abɔ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">Otumfo no home ma me nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Sɛ wubetumi a, ma me mmuae;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">siesie wo ho, na ka si mʼanim.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Wo ne me nyinaa yɛ pɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn anim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">me nso wɔbɔɔ me fii dɔte mu.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ wusuro me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">na ɛnsɛ sɛ me nsa yɛ den wɔ wo so.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>“Nanso woaka ama mate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">mete saa nsɛm no, na wokae se,<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>‘Meyɛ kronkron na minni bɔne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">me ho tew na afɔdi biara nni me ho.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Nanso Onyankopɔn anya me ho mfomso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">wafa me sɛ ne tamfo.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Ɔde me nan hyɛ mpokyerɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">na nʼani wɔ mʼakwan nyinaa so.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>“Nanso meka mekyerɛ wo se, eyi mu de woayɛ mfomso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">efisɛ Onyankopɔn so sen ɔdesani.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Na adɛn nti na wunwiinwii hyɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">sɛ ommua onipa nsɛm biara ana?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Nanso Onyankopɔn kasa wɔ akwan ahorow so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">na ebia nnipa nte.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Ɔkasa wɔ daeso ne anadwo anisoadehu mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">bere a nna afa nnipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">na wɔada hatee wɔ wɔn mpa so no,<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>otumi kasa gu wɔn asom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">na ɔde kɔkɔbɔ yi wɔn hu,<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>sɛ ɔbɛdan onipa afi nneyɛe bɔne ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">na watwe no afi ahantan ho,<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>sɛ ɔmma ne kra nkɔ amoa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">na ɔnhwere ne nkwa wɔ afoa ano.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>Anaasɛ wotumi de mpa so yaw twe onipa aso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">nnompe mu yaw a ennyae da,<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>kosi sɛ ne kɔn nnɔ aduan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">na ne kra nso po aduan a ɛyɛ akɔnnɔ pa ara;<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>ɔfɔn yɛ basaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">na ne nnompe a anka ɛho akata no, ho da hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Ne kra bɛn ɔda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">na ne nkwa bɛn owu abɔfo.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>“Nanso sɛ ɔbɔfo bi wɔ nʼafa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">sɛ odimafo a, ɛyɛ apem mu baako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">na ɔbɛkyerɛ no nea eye ma no,<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>obehu no mmɔbɔ na waka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Munnyaa no na wankɔ ɔda mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">na manya mpatade ama no,’<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>afei ne were yɛ foforo sɛ abofra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">na esi ne dedaw mu yɛ sɛ mmerantebere mu de.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Ɔbɔ Onyankopɔn mpae na onya adom fi ne hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">ohu Onyankopɔn anim na ɔde ahosɛpɛw teɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">na Onyankopɔn gye no bio sɛ ɔtreneeni.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Afei ɔba nnipa mu bɛka se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Meyɛɛ bɔne na mekyeaa nea ɛteɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">nanso mannya nea ɛfata me.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Ogyee me kra na wamma no ankɔ ɔda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">enti mɛtena ase na madi hann no mu dɛ.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>“Onyankopɔn yɛ eyinom nyinaa ma onipa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">mprenu ne ne mprɛnsa so,<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>sɛnea ne kra renkɔ ɔda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">na nkwa hann no ahyerɛn ne so.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>“Yɛ aso, Hiob, na tie me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">yɛ dinn na menkasa.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Na sɛ wowɔ biribi ka a, bua me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">kasa, na mepɛ sɛ wobu wo bem.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Sɛ ɛnte saa nso a, ɛno de tie me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:33">Yɛ dinn na mɛkyerɛ wo nyansa.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Afei Elihu kae se,<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>“Mo anyansafo, muntie me nsɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">mo nimdefo monyɛ aso mma me.<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Efisɛ aso sɔ nsɛm hwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">sɛnea tɛkrɛma ka aduan hwɛ no.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Momma yɛnsese, nhu nea eye ma yɛn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">Momma yɛn nyinaa mmɔ mu nsua nea eye.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>“Hiob ka se, ‘Me ho nni asɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">nanso Onyankopɔn abu me ntɛnkyew.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Ɛwɔ mu sɛ mʼasɛm da kwan mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">nanso wobu me ɔtorofo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">ɛwɔ mu sɛ menyɛɛ bɔne biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">nanso ne bɛmma no ama me apirakuru a enwu da.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Onipa bɛn na ɔte sɛ Hiob a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">ɔnom animtiaabu sɛ nsu?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Ɔne amumɔyɛfo nantew;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">na ɔne atirimɔdenfo nso bɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Efisɛ ɔka se, ‘Sɛ onipa bɔ mmɔden sɛ ɔbɛsɔ Onyankopɔn ani a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">onnya so mfaso biara.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>“Enti mo mmarima a mowɔ ntease muntie me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Ɛmpare Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔbɛyɛ bɔne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">sɛ Otumfo no bɛyɛ mfomso.<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Nnipa nneyɛe so na ɔhwɛ tua wɔn ka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">nea ɛfata ne nneyɛe na ɔma ɛba ne so.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Ɛmfata sɛ wɔde mfomso susuw Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">na ɛmfata sɛ wɔde ntɛnkyew susuw Otumfo.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Hena na ɔde no sii asase so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Hena na ɔde wiase nyinaa hyɛɛ ne nsa?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Sɛ ɛyɛɛ ne pɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">na oyii ne Honhom ne nʼahome a,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>anka adesamma nyinaa bɛbɔ mu ayera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">na onipa bɛsan akɔ mfutuma mu.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>“Sɛ mowɔ nhumu a, muntie eyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">muntie nea meka.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>So obi a okyi atɛntrenee betumi adi nnipa so?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Mubetumi abu Ɔtreneeni kɛse no fɔ ana?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Ɛnyɛ Ɔno na ɔka kyerɛ ahemfo se, ‘Mo so nni mfaso,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">na ɔka kyerɛɛ atitiriw se, ‘Moyɛ atirimɔdenfo,’<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>nea ɔnhwɛ mmapɔmma anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">na onyiyi adefo ne ahiafo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">efisɛ wɔn nyinaa yɛ ne nsa ano adwuma.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Wowuwu mmere tiaa bi mu, wɔ anadwo dasu mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">nnipa no ho wosow na wɔsen kɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">ahoɔdenfo totɔ a emfi nipa.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>“Nʼani hwɛ nnipa akwan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">na ohu wɔn anammɔntu biara.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Baabiara nni hɔ a aduru sum, sum kabii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">a amumɔyɛfo betumi ahintaw.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Ɛho nhia Onyankopɔn sɛ ɔbɛhwehwɛ nnipa mu bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">a enti ɛsɛ sɛ wɔba nʼanim begye atemmu.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Ɔbobɔ abirɛmpɔn gu a ɔnyɛ nhwehwɛmu biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">na ɔde afoforo sisi wɔn anan mu.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Efisɛ ohu wɔn nneyɛe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">otu wɔn gu anadwo na wɔdwerɛw wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Otua wɔn amumɔyɛsɛm so ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">wɔ faako a obiara betumi ahu wɔn,<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>efisɛ wɔman fii nʼakyi kɔe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">na wɔampɛ nʼakwan biara anhwɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Wɔmaa ahiafo sufrɛ duu nʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">na ɛma ɔtee mmɔborɔni su.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Nanso sɛ ɔyɛ komm a, hena na obetumi abu no fɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Sɛ ɔde nʼanim hintaw nso a, hena na obehu no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Nanso odi onipa ne ɔman so pɛpɛɛpɛ,<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>ɔmma onipa a onnim Nyame nni hene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">sɛnea ɔrensum nnipa no mfiri.<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>“Sɛ ɛba sɛ onipa ka kyerɛ Onyankopɔn se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Mayɛ bɔne na merenyɛ bɔne bio.<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Kyerɛ me na minhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">na sɛ mayɛ bɔne a, merenyɛ saa bio.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>So ɛsɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn gyina nea woka so tua wo ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">wɔ bere a woayɛ sɛ worennu wo ho ana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Ɛsɛ sɛ wusi gyinae, ɛnyɛ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">enti ka nea wunim kyerɛ me.<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>“Nnipa a wɔwɔ ntease pae mu ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">nimdefo a wotie me ka kyerɛ me se,<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‘Hiob nkasa nimdeɛ kwan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">aba biara nni ne kasa mu.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Ao, sɛ wɔsɔɔ Hiob hwɛ kɔɔ akyiri a anka eye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">efisɛ oyiyii nsɛm ano sɛ omumɔyɛfo!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Ɔde atuatew ka ne bɔne ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">ɔde ahantan bɔ ne nsam gu yɛn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">na ɔma ne nsɛm a ɔka tia Onyankopɔn no dɔɔso.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Afei, Elihu kae se:<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>“Wugye di sɛ, eyi fata?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">Woka se, ‘Onyankopɔn betwitwa agye me.’<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Nanso wubisa no se, ‘Mfaso bɛn na menya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">na sɛ manyɛ bɔne a, mfaso bɛn na menya?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>“Mepɛ sɛ mibua wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">ne wo nnamfonom nyinaa.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Ma wʼani so kyerɛ soro na hwɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">hwɛ omununkum a ɛwɔ wʼatifi sorosoro nohɔ. <verse eid="JOB 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Sɛ woyɛ bɔne a, ɔkwan bɛn so na ɛfa haw no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Mpo sɛ wo bɔne dɔɔso a, nsunsuanso bɛn na enya wɔ ne so?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Sɛ woteɛ a, dɛn na wode ma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">anaasɛ dɛn na onya fi wo nsam?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Wʼamumɔyɛ ka onipa a ɔte sɛ wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">na wo trenee ka nnipa mma nko ara.<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>“Nnipa su bere a wɔhyɛ wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">na wɔsrɛ mmoa fi nea ɔwɔ tumi nsam.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Nanso obi mmisa se, ‘Ɛhe na Onyankopɔn, me Yɛfo no wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">nea ɔma nnwom anadwo no,<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>nea ɔkyerɛ yɛn nimdeɛ bebree sen asase so mmoa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">na ɔma yehu nyansa sen wim nnomaa no?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Sɛ nnipa su teɛ mu a, ommua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">amumɔyɛfo ahantan nti.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Ampa ara Onyankopɔn rentie wɔn nkotosrɛ hunu no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">na Otumfo remmu.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Ɛno de adɛn na ɔrentie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">bere a woka se wunhu no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">na woka se wʼasɛm wɔ nʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">enti ɛsɛ sɛ wotwɛn no,<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>na bio, nʼabufuw mmfa asotwe mma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">na nʼani nni amumɔyɛsɛm akyi pii?<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Enti Hiob bue nʼano ka nsɛnhunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">nimdeɛ a onni nti, ɔkeka nsɛm bebree.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Elihu toaa ne kasa so se,<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>“Montɔ mo bo ase kakra mma me, na mɛkyerɛ mo sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">aka bebree a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛka ma Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Minya me nimdeɛ fi akyirikyiri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">mɛka se me Yɛfo bu atɛntrenee.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Munnye nto mu sɛ me nsɛm yɛ nokware turodoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">na meyɛ obi a ne nimdeɛ so wɔ mo mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>“Onyankopɔn so, nanso, ontwiri nnipa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">ɔkorɔn na osi pi wɔ ne botae mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Ɔmma amumɔyɛfo ntena nkwa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">na ɔde amanehunufo kyɛfa ma wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Onnyi nʼani mfi ɔtreneeni so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">ɔma wɔne ahemfo di ade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">na ɔma wɔn so afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Na sɛ wɔde mpokyerɛ gu nnipa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">na amanehunu hama akyekyere wɔn papee a,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>ɔka nea wɔayɛ kyerɛ wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">sɛ wɔnam ahantan so ayɛ bɔne.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Ɔma wotie nteɛso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">na ɔhyɛ wɔn sɛ wonnu wɔn ho wɔ wɔn bɔne ho.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Sɛ wɔyɛ osetie na wɔsom no a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">wobedi yiye wɔ wɔn nna a aka no mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">na wɔn mfe nyinaa ayɛ anisɔ ama wɔn.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Na sɛ wɔantie no a, wɔbɛyera wɔ afoa ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">na wɔawuwu a wonni nimdeɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>“Wɔn a wonnim Nyame no kora abufuw so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">mpo sɛ ogu wɔn nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn a wonsu mpɛ mmoa.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Wowuwu wɔ wɔn mmabunmmere mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">wɔ mmarima nguamanfo a wɔtete abosonnan mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Nanso wɔn a wohu amane no, ogye wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">na ɔkasa kyerɛ wɔn wɔ wɔn haw mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>“Ɔregye wo afi ahohia mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">de wo akɔ beae a hɔ bae a ahokyere nni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">nea wowɔ asomdwoe, na nnuan pa ayɛ wo pon so ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Nanso mprempren, atemmu a ɛfata amumɔyɛfo na aba wo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">atemmu ne atɛntrenee aso wo mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Hwɛ yiye na obi amfa ahonya annaadaa wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">mma adanmude kɛse bi ntwe wo.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Wʼahonya anaasɛ mpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">wʼahohia bebrebe nyinaa nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">worenkɔ amanehunu mu ana?<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Mpere anadwo ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">sɛ ammɛpra nnipa mfi wɔn afi mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Hwɛ na woannan ankɔ bɔne ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">nea ayɛ sɛ wopɛ sen amanehunu.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>“Onyankopɔn yɛ ɔkɛse wɔ ne tumi mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">Hena na ɔyɛ ɔkyerɛkyerɛfo sɛ ɔno?<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Hena na wahyehyɛ nʼakwan ama no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">anaa waka akyerɛ no se, ‘Woayɛ mfomso.’<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Kae na kamfo nʼadwuma a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">nnipa de nnwonto akamfo no.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Adesamma nyinaa ahu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">nnipa fi akyirikyiri hwɛ no haa.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Onyankopɔn yɛ ɔkɛse, ɛboro yɛn ntease so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">Ne mfe dodow mu nni hwehwɛbea.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>“Ɔtwetwe nsu a ɛsosɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">ma ɛdan osu gu nsuten mu;<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>na omununkum tɔ obosu gu fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">na osu pete mmoroso gu adesamma so.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Hena na obetumi ate sɛnea ɔtrɛtrɛw omununkum mu no ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">sɛnea ɔbobɔ mu fi ne suhyɛ ase no?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Hwɛ sɛnea ɔhwete nʼanyinam mu wɔ ne ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">ma ɛkɔ po bun mu.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Eyi ne ɔkwan a ɔfa so di amanaman no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">na ɔma aduan bu wɔn so.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Ɔde anyinam hyɛ ne nsam ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">na ɔhyɛ no sɛ ɛmpa nʼagyiraehyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Nʼaprannaa bɔ ahum a ɛreba no ho nkae;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">na anantwi mpo ma wohu sɛ ɛreba.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>“Eyi ma me koma bɔ kitirikitiri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">na ehuruw fi nʼatenae.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Tie! Tie ne nne mmubomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">ne huuyɛ a efi nʼanom reba no.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Ogyaa nʼanyinam mu wɔ ɔsoro ase nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">na ɔma ekodu asase ano.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Ɛno akyi na ne mmubomu no ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">ɔde nne kɛse bobɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Sɛ ɔkasa a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">biribiara nsianka no.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Onyankopɔn nne bobɔ mu ma no yɛ nwonwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">ɔyɛ nneɛma akɛse a ɛboro yɛn adwene so.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Ɔka kyerɛ sukyerɛmma se, ‘Tɔ gu asase so,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">ne osu nso se, ‘Yɛ osutɔ kɛse.’<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Sɛnea nnipa a wabɔ wɔn nyinaa behu nʼadwuma nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">ɔma nnipa nyinaa gyae wɔn adwumayɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Wuram mmoa kɔtetɛw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">wɔkɔhyehyɛ wɔn abon mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Ahum tu fi ne pia mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">na awɔw nso fi mframa a ɛrebɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Onyankopɔn home de sukyerɛmma ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">na nsu tamaa no kyen.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Ɔde fuonwini hyɛ omununkum ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">na otwa nʼanyinam fa mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Ɔhyɛ ma wokyinkyin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">fa asase so nyinaa hyia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">yɛ nea ɔhyɛ sɛ wɔnyɛ biara.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Ɔde omununkum ba bɛtwe nnipa aso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">anaasɛ ɔma ɛtɔ gu asase so de kyerɛ nʼadɔe.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>“Tie eyi, Hiob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">gyae na dwene Onyankopɔn anwonwade ho.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Wunim sɛnea Onyankopɔn si fa di omununkum so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">na ɔma nʼanyinam twa?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Wunim sɛnea omununkum si fa sensɛn wim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">nea ɔwɔ nimdeɛ a so nni no anwonwade no?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Mo a mufi fifiri wɔ mo ntade mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">bere a anafo mframa ma asase no yɛ dinn no,<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>wubetumi aboa no ama watrɛw wim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">a ɛyɛ den sɛ kɔbere mfrafrae ahwehwɛ?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>“Kyerɛ yɛn nea ɛsɛ sɛ yɛka kyerɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">yɛrentumi nka yɛn asɛm, efisɛ yennim.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔka nea mepɛ sɛ meka kyerɛ no ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Onipa bi wɔ hɔ a ɔbɛpɛ sɛ wɔbɛmene no ana?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Obiara rentumi nhwɛ owia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">sɛnea ɛhyerɛn wɔ wim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">bere a mframa abɔ ama wim atew.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Ofi atifi fam ba wɔ anuonyam sononko mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Onyankopɔn ba wɔ ahenni nwonwaso mu.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Otumfo no korɔn wɔ yɛn so na wɔpagyaw no wɔ tumi mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">nʼatɛntrenee ne treneeyɛ kɛse akyi no mpo, ɔnyɛ nhyɛso.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Ɛno nti nnipa de nidi ma no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">efisɛ onnwen koma mu anyansafo nyinaa ho ana?”<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Bisa Hiob Nsɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi ahum mu buaa Hiob se,<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>“Hena ne nea ɔde nsɛm a nimdeɛ nni mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">kata me nhyehyɛe so?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Hyɛ wo ho den sɛ ɔbarima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">mebisa wo nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">na wubebua me.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>“Bere a metoo asase fapem no, na wowɔ he?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Sɛ wote ase, ka ɛ.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Hena na osusuw ne tenten ne ne trɛw? Ampa ara wunim!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Hena na ɔtwee susuhama faa ani?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Dɛn so na egyina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">anaa hena na ɔtoo ne tweatibo no,<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>bere a anɔpa nsoromma bɔɔ mu too dwom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">na abɔfo nyinaa de anigye teɛɛ mu no?<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>“Hena na ɔkaa po hyɛɛ apon akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">bere a epue fii ɔyafunu mu,<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>bere a mede omununkum yɛɛ nʼadurade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">na mede sum kabii kyekyeree no,<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>bere a metoo ɔhye maa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">na misisii nʼapon ne nʼadaban,<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>bere a mekae se, ‘Ɛha ara na wubedu na worentra ha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">ɛha na wʼahantan asorɔkye no bɛso no?’<verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>“So woahyɛ mmara ama adekyee da?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">Na woakyerɛ ahemadakye nso afa,<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>sɛ ɛnkɔka asase ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">na ontu amumɔyɛfo mfi so?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Asase fa ne bɔbea sɛ dɔte a ɛhyɛ nsɔwano ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">na ɛsow tebea da wɔn ho adi te sɛ atade.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Wɔde amumɔyɛfo hann akame wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">na wɔn abasa a wɔama so no mu abu.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>“So woapɛɛpɛɛ mu ahu nea po aniwa wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">anaa woanantew ne bun mu pɛn?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>So wɔde owu apon akyerɛ wo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Woahu owu sunsuma apon ana?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Woate wiase a ɛda hɔ tamaa no ase ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Sɛ wunim eyinom nyinaa a, ka kyerɛ me.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>“Ɔkwan bɛn na ɛkɔ hann atenae?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Na ɛhe na sum te?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Wubetumi de wɔn akɔ wɔn sibea?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Wunim akwan a ɛkɔ wɔn atenae?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Ampa ara wunim, efisɛ na wɔawo wo dedaw.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">Woanyin yiye!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>“Woakɔ sukyerɛmma adekoradan mu da</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">anaa woahu mparuwbo adekoradan<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>a makora so ama ahohia bere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">ɔsa ne akodi nna?<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Ɔkwan bɛn na ɛkɔ faako a anyinam fi ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">anaa faako a apuei mframa fi na ɛbɔ fa asase so?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Hena na otwaa ɛka maa osuhweam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">ne ɔkwan maa aprannaa mmubomu,<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>sɛ ɛbɛtɔ agu asase a obiara nte so so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">nweatam a obiara nni so,<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>na ama asase kesee a ɛda mpan afɔw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">na sare afifi wɔ so?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Osu wɔ agya ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Hena na ɔyɛ agya ma obosu a ɛsosɔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Hena yafunu mu na sukyerɛmma fi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Hena na ɔwoo sukyerɛmma mporoporowa fi soro<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>bere a nsu kyen dan sɛ ɔbo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">na bun ani kyen?<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>“Wubetumi de hama akyekyere Akokɔbeatan ne ne mma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Wubetumi asan Nyankrɛnte hama ana?<verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Wubetumi de anɔpa nsoromma aba wɔ ne bere mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">anaasɛ wubetumi ayi sisi ne ne mma afi hɔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>So wunim mmara a ɛfa ɔsoro ho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Wubetumi de Onyankopɔn ahenni aba asase so ana?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>“Wubetumi ama wo nne adu omununkum so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">na wode nsu akata wo ho ana?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Wutumi ma anyinam twa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Wɔka kyerɛ wo se, ‘Yenni’ ana?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Hena na ɔde nyansa ma koma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">anaasɛ ɔde ntease hyɛ adwene mu?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Hena na ɔwɔ nyansa a wɔde kan omununkum?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">Hena na obetumi akyea ɔsoro nsu nkotoku,<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>bere a mfutuma ayɛ den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">ama dɔte atɔwatɔw keka bɔ mu.<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>“Wokɔ ahayɛ ma gyatabere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">ma gyata didi mee<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>bere a wobutubutuw wɔn abon ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">anaasɛ wɔtetɛw adɔtɔ ase?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Hena na ɔma kwaakwaadabi aduan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">bere a ne mma su frɛ Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">na wonni aduan nti wokyinkyin?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>“So wunim bere a bepɔw so mmirekyi wowo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Woahwɛ, ahu bere a ɔforote nyinsɛn ne ba?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>So woakan asram dodow a wɔde nyinsɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Wunim bere a wɔwo ana?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Wɔkotow wowo wɔn mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">wɔn awoko yaw to twa.<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Wɔn mma nyin ahoɔden so wɔ wuram;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">na wogyaw wɔn awofo hɔ a wɔnnsan nkɔ wɔn nkyɛn bio.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>“Hena na ɔma wuram afurum fa ne ho di?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Hena na ɔsan ne hama?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Mede asase kesee maa no sɛ ne fi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">ne nkyene asase tamaa sɛ nʼatenae.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Ɔserew kurom gyegyeegyeyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">na ɔnte ɔkafo nteɛteɛmu.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Okyinkyin mmepɔw no so sɛ ne didibea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">ɛhɔ na okyin hwehwɛ wura amono biara.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>“Ɛko bɛpene sɛ ɔbɛsom wo ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Ɔbɛtena wo mmoa adididaka nkyɛn anadwo ana?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Wubetumi asa no wɔ funtumfiri so ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Ɔbɛfɛntɛm aku a ɛda wʼakyi no ana?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Wubetumi de wo ho ato no so esiane nʼahoɔden dodo nti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Wubegyaw wʼadwuma a ɛyɛ den no ama no ana?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Wugye di sɛ ɔde wʼaburow bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">na waboa ano de akɔ awiporowbea ana?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>“Sohori bɔ ne ntaban mu anigye so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">nanso wontumi mfa ntoto asukɔnkɔn de ho.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Ɔtow ne nkesua gu asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">ma mfutuma ka no hyew,<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>ɛmfa ne ho sɛ ɛnan bi bɛpɛtɛw no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">sɛ wuram aboa bi betiatia so.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Ɔbɔ ne mma atirimɔden sɛnea wɔnyɛ ne dea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">ɛmfa ne ho sɛ nʼadwuma bɛyɛ ɔkwa,<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>efisɛ Onyankopɔn amma no nyansa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">wamma no nhumu biara.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Nanso sɛ ɔtrɛw ne ntaban mu tu mmirika a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">ɔserew ɔpɔnkɔ ne ne sotefo.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>“Wo na woma ɔpɔnkɔ no nʼahoɔden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">anaa woma ne kɔn mu nwi kuhaa no?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Wo na woma no huruw te sɛ mmoadabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">na ɔde ne nkotɔ hunahuna ana?<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Ɔde ne nan tintim fam dennen, na nʼani gye nʼahoɔden mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">na afei ɔbɔ wura ɔko mu.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Ɔmmɔ hu, na onsuro biribiara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">ohu afoa a onguan.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Bɛmma wosow wɔ ne nkyɛn mu boha mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">na peaw ne pɛmɛ nso di ahim wɔ ne ho.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Ofi ahopere mu de nʼano sisi fam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">na sɛ wɔhyɛn torobɛnto a ontumi nnyina faako.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Sɛ torobɛnto hyɛn a ɔka se, ‘Wiɛ!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ɔte ɔko ho hua fi akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">ɔsahene no nteɛmu ne ɔko mu osebɔ.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>“Wo nyansa na ɛma akoroma tu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">na ɔtrɛw ne ntaban mu fa anafo?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Wo na wohyɛ ɔkɔre ma no tu kɔ sorosoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">kɔyɛ ne berebuw wɔ hɔ?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Ɔbotan mu na ɔte na ɛhɔ na ɔda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">ɔbotan sorɔnsorɔn yɛ nʼabandennen.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Ɛhɔ na ofi kɔhwehwɛ nʼaduan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">nʼani hu ade a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Mogya yɛ ne mma aduan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">na faako a atɔfo wɔ no, ɛhɔ na ɔwɔ.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa Hiob se,<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>“Nea ɔne Otumfo no wɔ asɛm no bɛteɛ ne so ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Ma nea ɔbɔ Onyankopɔn kwaadu no mmua no ɛ!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Na Hiob buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>“Mensɛ na memfata, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na matumi anya mmuae?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Mede me nsa mua mʼano.<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Makasa baako, nanso minni mmuae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">mprenu so, na merenkasa bio.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi ahum mu buaa Hiob se,<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>“Hyɛ wo ho den sɛ ɔbarima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">mebisa wo nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">na ɛsɛ sɛ wubua me.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>“Wobɛka mʼatemmu ho asɛm bɔne ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">Wubebu me fɔ de abu wo ho bem ana?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Wowɔ abasa te sɛ Onyankopɔn de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">na wo nne betumi abobɔ mu sɛ ne de ana?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Ɛno de fa anuonyam ne ɔhyerɛn hyehyɛ wo ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">na fura nidi ne kɛseyɛ.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Hwie wʼabufuwhyew mmoroso no gu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">hwɛ ɔhantanni biara na brɛ no ase,<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>hwɛ ɔhantanni biara na si no fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">na tiatia amumɔyɛfo so wɔ faako a wogyina hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Sie wɔn nyinaa bɔ mu wɔ mfutuma mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">kata wɔn anim wɔ ɔda mu.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Na afei mʼankasa megye ato mu sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">wo ara wo basa nifa betumi agye wo nkwa.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>“Hwɛ susono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">nea meyɛɛ no kaa wo ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">na ɔwe sare te sɛ nantwi.<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Hwɛ ahoɔden a ɔwɔ wɔ nʼasen mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">ne ahoɔden a ɛwɔ ne yafunu so were mu!<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Ne dua hinhim sɛ sida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">ne srɛ mu ntin yɛ peperee.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Ne nnompe te sɛ kɔbere mfrafrae dorobɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">nʼabasa ne ne nʼanan te sɛ nnade praban.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Odi Onyankopɔn nsa ano adwuma mu kan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">nanso ne Yɛfo betumi de nʼafoa akɔ ne so.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Nkoko fifi wɔn nnɔbae ma no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">na wuram mmoa nyinaa goru bɛn hɔ.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Nsɔensɔe nnua ase na ɔda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">na dontori mu demmire akata no so.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Nsɔensɔe nwini no kata ne so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">na nsunoa nnua twa ne ho hyia.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Nsu nworoso nhaw no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">mpo sɛ Yordan bobɔ ba nʼano a, onni ɔhaw.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Obi betumi akyere no animono;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">anaa obi betumi de afiri ayi no na wabɔre ne hwene mu ana?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>“So wubetumi de darewa atwe ɔdɛnkyɛmmirampɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">anaa wubetumi de hama akyekyere ne tɛkrɛma?<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>So wubetumi de hama afa ne hwenem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">anaasɛ wubetumi de darewa aso nʼabogye mu?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Ɔbɛkɔ so asrɛ wo sɛ hu no mmɔbɔ ana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Ɔne wo bɛkasa brɛoo ana?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Ɔbɛpene ne wo ayɛ apam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">ama wode no ayɛ wʼakoa afebɔɔ ana?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Wubetumi de no ayɛ abɛbɛ te sɛ anomaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">anaa wubetumi asa no hama de no ama wo mmabea?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>So aguadifo bɛpɛ sɛ wode no bedi nsesagua?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Wɔbɛkyekyɛ ne mu ama aguadifo ana?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Wubetumi de mpeaw awowɔ ne were mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">anaasɛ wode mpataa mpɛmɛ bɛwowɔ ne ti ho?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Wode wo nsa ka no a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">wobɛkae sɛnea ɔbɛwosow ne ho, nti worenyɛ saa bio!<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Ɔkwan biara nni hɔ a wobɛfa so akyere no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ani a ɛbɔ ne so kɛkɛ no ma nnipa dwudwo.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Obiara ntumi nsi ne bo nhwanyan no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">Afei hena na obetumi ne me adi asi?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Hena na mede no ka a ɛsɛ sɛ mitua?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Biribiara a ɛhyɛ ɔsoro ase no yɛ me de.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>“Me werɛ remfi sɛ mɛka nʼakwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">nʼahoɔden ne ne bɔbea fɛfɛ no ho asɛm.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Hena na obetumi aworɔw ne ho ahama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">na hena na ɔde nnareka bɛkɔ ne ho?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Hena na obetumi abue nʼabogye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">a ɛse a ɛyɛ hu ayɛ no ma no?<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Nʼakyi wɔ bona a ɛsesa so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">ɛtetare so a ɔkwan nna mu koraa;<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>sɛnea ɛtetare so fa no nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">mframa biara mfa ntam.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Ɛtoatoa mu denneennen a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">emu ntumi ntetew.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Sɛ ɔnwansi a, ɛpepa gya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">nʼaniwa aba te sɛ adekyeenim hann.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Agyatɛn turuw fi nʼanom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">na nsramma turuturuw fi mu.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Wusiw sen fi ne hwene mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">te sɛ ɔsɛn a esi gya so.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Ne home ma gyabiriw ano sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">na ogyaframa tu fi nʼanom.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Ne kɔn mu wɔ ahoɔden ankasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">wɔn a wohu no no aba mu bu.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Ne were a abubu agu so no yɛ peperee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">ayɛ pemee a ɛnka ne ho.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Ne koko so yɛ den sɛ ɔbotan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">ɛyɛ den sɛ awiyammo.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Sɛ ɔsɔre a, ahoɔdenfo bɔ huboa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">sɛ ɔwosow ne ho a woguan.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Afoa wɔ no a, ɛnka no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">peaw, pɛmɛ ne agyan nso saa ara.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>Ɔfa dade sɛ wura bi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">na kɔbere mfrafrae te sɛ dua a awu bi ma no.<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Agyan mma no nguan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">ahwimmo mu aboa yɛ ntɛtɛ ma no.<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Kontibaa te sɛ sare wɔ nʼani so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">na ɔserew pɛmɛ nnyigyei.<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Abon a ano yɛ nnam tuatua ne yafunu so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">Ɔtwe ne ho ase wɔ fam fa dontori mu a, eyiyi akam.<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Ɔma bun mu huru sɛ nsu a ɛwɔ ɛsɛn mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">na onunu po mu sɛ srade a ɛwɔ kuku mu.<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Nea ɔbɛfa no, ɛhɔ nsu no pa yerɛw yerɛw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">na obi besusuw sɛ po bun adan ayɛ dwen.<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>Asase so biribiara ne no nsɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">Ɔyɛ abɔde a onsuro hwee.<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>Ommu wɔn a wɔyɛ ahantan no mu biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">ɔyɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ ahomaso no nyinaa so hene.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Hiob Bua <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Na Hiob buaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se,<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>“Minim sɛ wutumi yɛ nneɛma nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">obiara rentumi nsɛe wo nhyehyɛe.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Wubisa se, ‘Hena ni a onni nimdeɛ nso osiw mʼafotu ho kwan?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Ampa ara mekaa nneɛma a mente ase no ho nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">nneɛma a ɛyɛ nwonwa ma me.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>“Wokae se, ‘Tie na menkasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">mebisa wo nsɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">na ɛsɛ sɛ woma me mmuae.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Mate wo nka pɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">na mprempren de, mʼani ahu wo.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Ɛno nti mibu me ho animtiaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">na mete mfutuma ne nsõ mu de kyerɛ mʼahonu.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awiei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa nsɛm yi kyerɛɛ Hiob wiei no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Temanni Elifas se, “Me bo afuw wo ne wo nnamfonom baanu no, efisɛ moanka me ho asɛm a ɛyɛ nokware sɛnea me somfo Hiob kae no. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Afei, momfa anantwi ason ne adwennini ason, na monkɔ me somfo Hiob nkyɛn, na monkɔbɔ ɔhyew afɔre mma mo ho. Me somfo Hiob bɛbɔ mpae ama mo, na metie ne mpaebɔ no na merenyɛ mo sɛnea ɛfata mo nkwaseasɛm no, nsɛm a moka faa me ho no nyɛ nokware sɛnea me somfo Hiob yɛe no.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Enti Temanni Elifas ne Suhini Bildad ne Naamani Sofar yɛɛ sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ wɔn no; na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tiee Hiob mpaebɔ.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Hiob bɔɔ mpae maa ne nnamfonom akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> san yɛɛ no ɔdefo bio na ɔde nʼahode a na ɔwɔ kan no mmɔho abien maa no. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Afei, ne nuabarimanom, ne nuabeanom nyinaa ne obiara a na onim no dedaw no baa ne fi ne no bedidii. Wɔkyekyee ne werɛ wɔ amanehunu a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma ɔkɔɔ mu no ho, na wɔn mu biara brɛɛ no dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ kaa.<verse eid="JOB 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyiraa Hiob nkwa awiei sen ne mfiase. Onyaa nguan mpem dunan, yoma mpem asia, anantwinini mpamho apem ne mfurum abere apem. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Bio onyaa mmabarima baason ne mmabea baasa. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Ɔtoo ne babea piesie no din Yemima, na nea odi so no Kesia na nea ɔto so abiɛsa no de Keren-Hapuk. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Asase no so nyinaa, na mmaa biara nni hɔ a wɔn ho yɛ fɛ sɛ Hiob mmabea no, na wɔn agya de wɔn kaa wɔn nuabarimanom no ho maa wɔn agyapade.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Eyi akyi no, Hiob dii mfirihyia ɔha aduanan; ohuu ne mma ne ne nenanom awo ntoatoaso anan. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Afei owui a na wabɔ akwakoraa pa ara.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
